, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Soft-shelled clam meat from the northern shipwreck was the favored bait, prompting an offer of payment for gathering it.",["title"]="Mai'Lahii"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6164:description:1-23","6164:description:26-42","6164:description:47-56","6164:description:58-102","6164:description:105-161","6164:description:166-203","6164:description:206-231","6164:description:233-255","6164:description:260-276","6164:description:279-301","6164:description:304-335","6164:description:338-395","6164:objective:1-67"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6164,["sourceHash"]="29543b9f6ea4725830d0fca7ceb0346414ae4e7c0d22f0f35b1b3df10b74fc8e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-12384",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Augustus wanted to reopen a shop but insisted that the missing receipt book was necessary to keep track of business.",["title"]="Augustus the Touched"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6164:description:1-23","6164:description:26-42","6164:description:47-56","6164:description:58-102","6164:description:105-161","6164:description:166-203","6164:description:206-231","6164:description:233-255","6164:description:260-276","6164:description:279-301","6164:description:304-335","6164:description:338-395","6164:objective:1-67"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6164,["sourceHash"]="29543b9f6ea4725830d0fca7ceb0346414ae4e7c0d22f0f35b1b3df10b74fc8e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-12384",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He thought he had left it in his former inn room, promising remarkable prices if a helper brought it back.",["title"]="Augustus the Touched"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6261:description:1-58","6261:description:61-83","6261:description:88-173","6261:description:176-242","6261:description:247-313","6261:description:316-398","6261:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6261,["sourceHash"]="360d0f18beb5d639d1d786f7ba7e57875b97fef8d14947aaa154f39e119f74d9"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-1323",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Osric Strang prepared the crate of equipment requested for Westfall’s fighting men and women.",["title"]="Osric Strang"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6261:description:1-58","6261:description:61-83","6261:description:88-173","6261:description:176-242","6261:description:247-313","6261:description:316-398","6261:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6261,["sourceHash"]="360d0f18beb5d639d1d786f7ba7e57875b97fef8d14947aaa154f39e119f74d9"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1323",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He directed the shipment toward Dungar’s gryphons so it could reach Thor and Lewis quickly rather than leave the defenders waiting.",["title"]="Osric Strang"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6281:description:1-94","6281:description:97-137","6281:description:142-227","6281:description:230-287","6281:objective:1-148"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6281,["sourceHash"]="f9151542677103150dbb16e0ca42c77ea1f99453051a9a716ab3969a3d5111b8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-523",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Thor arranged paid gryphon passage from Westfall to Stormwind, presenting it as the fastest way to carry Lewis’s requisition.",["title"]="Thor"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6322:description:1-55","6322:description:58-169","6322:description:174-228","6322:description:231-277","6322:objective:1-40"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6322,["sourceHash"]="62cffdd0d1da81962870f77d9eee3366d3231a8ea6d68e68d90096cb0ed6287d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-4556",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Gordon Wendham packed the Sepulcher’s supplies in the Undercity and sent the crate toward Michael Garrett’s bats for delivery.",["title"]="Gordon Wendham"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6323:description:1-62","6323:description:65-141","6323:description:146-212","6323:description:215-262","6323:objective:1-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6323,["sourceHash"]="d3e02722ab1b4a4cf8c30715bf58c354e6d363c3143c037668ccdad36c756db8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2226",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Karos Razok arranged paid bat travel from the Sepulcher to the Undercity, landing riders in the Trade Quarter near Gordon Wendham.",["title"]="Karos Razok"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6324:description:1-47","6324:description:50-123","6324:description:128-275","6324:description:280-346","6324:description:349-387","6324:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6324,["sourceHash"]="9290f7c7fcd422d167ec7824201d778d061a4d0d0bb50b2f9d9b0040ab169e13"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4551",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Michael Garrett coordinated the Undercity’s bats and return passage to Karos Razok at the Sepulcher.",["title"]="Michael Garrett"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6344:description:1-80","6344:description:83-160","6344:description:165-266","6344:description:269-320","6344:objective:1-28"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6344,["sourceHash"]="eee54e062d0e9354b8285fa4d19d84fcc8222932a1fcceb1e6a6a68edda51ba2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-4241",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mydrannul’s friend Nessa Shadowsong sold fish in Rut’theran Village and needed a parcel carried to Darkshore.",["title"]="Mydrannul"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6344:description:1-80","6344:description:83-160","6344:description:165-266","6344:description:269-320","6344:objective:1-28"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6344,["sourceHash"]="eee54e062d0e9354b8285fa4d19d84fcc8222932a1fcceb1e6a6a68edda51ba2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4241",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He directed helpers through Darnassus’s portal west of the Temple Gardens to reach the village.",["title"]="Mydrannul"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6361:description:1-93","6361:description:96-164","6361:description:169-206","6361:description:211-275","6361:description:278-405","6361:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6361,["sourceHash"]="4263f4451b61f4fb7303d960d67db800b9ee07f330c269e2361b99a9389940bd"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3483",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jahan Hawkwing arranged for a bundle of Barrens hides to reach Ahanu’s leatherworking in Thunder Bluff.",["title"]="Jahan Hawkwing"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6361:description:1-93","6361:description:96-164","6361:description:169-206","6361:description:211-275","6361:description:278-405","6361:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6361,["sourceHash"]="4263f4451b61f4fb7303d960d67db800b9ee07f330c269e2361b99a9389940bd"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3483",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He recommended Devrak’s wind riders at the Crossroads as the quickest way to move the delivery.",["title"]="Jahan Hawkwing"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6344:description:1-80","6344:description:83-160","6344:description:165-266","6344:description:269-320","6344:objective:1-28"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6344,["sourceHash"]="eee54e062d0e9354b8285fa4d19d84fcc8222932a1fcceb1e6a6a68edda51ba2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10118",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nessa Shadowsong worked as a fishing merchant in Rut’theran Village.",["title"]="Nessa Shadowsong"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6361:description:1-93","6361:description:96-164","6361:description:169-206","6361:description:211-275","6361:description:278-405","6361:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6361,["sourceHash"]="4263f4451b61f4fb7303d960d67db800b9ee07f330c269e2361b99a9389940bd"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-8359",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ahanu made leather goods in Thunder Bluff, receiving hides sent from Jahan Hawkwing in the Barrens.",["title"]="Ahanu"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6362:description:1-63","6362:description:66-99","6362:description:104-169","6362:description:174-301","6362:description:304-338","6362:objective:1-126"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6362,["sourceHash"]="a54426f42d146886ce88056687f071defde1e3587a74a242e309ea0af81dda06"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3615",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Devrak arranged swift wind rider passage to Thunder Bluff for a small fee, carrying the hide shipment toward Ahanu.",["title"]="Devrak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6364:description:1-111","6364:description:114-253","6364:description:258-296","6364:description:299-379","6364:objective:1-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6364,["sourceHash"]="98b0856dceb5ab8591108be95b2e29aeeb981701ccccb4dd560c3047d6c6c0a3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2995",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tal arranged return wind rider passage to the Crossroads so leather goods could reach Jahan Hawkwing.",["title"]="Tal"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6365:description:1-64","6365:description:67-114","6365:description:117-149","6365:description:154-201","6365:description:204-311","6365:objective:1-48"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6365,["sourceHash"]="a9ff9a2b930ae484006f53dba7c4f6085deef3a1a06b350122e4689c7c4ccf7e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-3489",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Zargh wanted choice meat delivered as a gift to his friend Gryshka, Orgrimmar’s innkeeper.",["title"]="Zargh"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6365:description:1-64","6365:description:67-114","6365:description:117-149","6365:description:154-201","6365:description:204-311","6365:objective:1-48"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6365,["sourceHash"]="a9ff9a2b930ae484006f53dba7c4f6085deef3a1a06b350122e4689c7c4ccf7e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3489",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Devrak’s wind riders offered the quickest way to send the cuts onward from the Crossroads.",["title"]="Zargh"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6386:description:1-151","6386:description:156-278","6386:description:281-353","6386:description:358-396","6386:objective:1-124"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6386,["sourceHash"]="bfeecceeeab1868581db88fe015bc105544fa01e9bdaf0439b1c7e1774b6cc60"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-3310",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Doras arranged wind rider travel back to Devrak at the Crossroads, where Gryshka’s letter could be delivered to Zargh.",["title"]="Doras"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6388:description:1-49","6388:description:52-129","6388:description:134-236","6388:objective:1-55"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6388,["sourceHash"]="ece96d4b58ccd4d3104ce1587d1c2e2575db78506298d55797a18985b891d056"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4256",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Golnir Bouldertoe supplied honorary picks for Brock’s students and prepared them for the return to Thelsamar by gryphon.",["title"]="Golnir Bouldertoe"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6391:description:1-68","6391:description:71-124","6391:description:127-176","6391:description:179-277","6391:description:282-333","6391:objective:1-129"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6391,["sourceHash"]="2e504812b26468d3c71756ac1fd2de33f1912a9b40eb9843af6469616160e6ad"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-1572",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Thorgrum Borrelson arranged gryphon flights to Ironforge, landing travelers in the Great Forge district near Golnir’s mining guild.",["title"]="Thorgrum Borrelson"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6442:description:1-47","6442:description:52-150","6442:description:153-179","6442:description:184-247","6442:description:250-343","6442:description:348-383","6442:description:385-418","6442:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6442,["sourceHash"]="af26e40807e7f82b9674e86e6eb68d09fcbb1e0df8a21e04467d9834398b12da"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-12719",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Marukai opposed the naga returning to the Zoram Strand, determined to defend the coast his people had claimed despite not knowing the invaders’ purpose.",["title"]="Marukai"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6442:description:1-47","6442:description:52-150","6442:description:153-179","6442:description:184-247","6442:description:250-343","6442:description:348-383","6442:description:385-418","6442:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6442,["sourceHash"]="af26e40807e7f82b9674e86e6eb68d09fcbb1e0df8a21e04467d9834398b12da"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-12719",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He understood the coast as the resting place of Zoram, a doomed city long since submerged beneath the sea.",["title"]="Marukai"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6482:description:6-17","6482:description:27-44","6482:description:47-62","6482:description:65-130","6482:description:133-157","6482:description:162-245","6482:description:254-267","6482:objective:1-64"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6482,["sourceHash"]="27725451a6279dc37b39d4bd3945792914ac37e57bd6d3c130e31604f54e8fad"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-12818",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ruul’s furbolg captors mistook him for a bear and starved him until his strength began to fail.",["title"]="Ruul Snowhoof"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6482:description:6-17","6482:description:27-44","6482:description:47-62","6482:description:65-130","6482:description:133-157","6482:description:162-245","6482:description:254-267","6482:objective:1-64"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6482,["sourceHash"]="27725451a6279dc37b39d4bd3945792914ac37e57bd6d3c130e31604f54e8fad"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-12818",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He wanted news of his escape brought to his sister Yama at Splintertree Post.",["title"]="Ruul Snowhoof"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6503:description:1-133","6503:description:136-193","6503:description:198-293","6503:description:296-343","6503:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6503,["sourceHash"]="ac20f04b6f3da296ceb411ff6c37799fcdf77eae8246d4213c85b47e8f6f8aaa"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-12867",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kuray’bin wanted to prevent Alliance outrunners from gathering intelligence on the outpost’s defenses.",["title"]="Kuray'bin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6503:description:1-133","6503:description:136-193","6503:description:198-293","6503:description:296-343","6503:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6503,["sourceHash"]="ac20f04b6f3da296ceb411ff6c37799fcdf77eae8246d4213c85b47e8f6f8aaa"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-12867",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Reports placed the scouts south of the post and east of Silverwing after they left the Alliance outpost.",["title"]="Kuray'bin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6523:description:1-26","6523:description:28-85","6523:description:87-119","6523:description:121-146","6523:description:151-219","6523:objective:1-114"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6523,["sourceHash"]="ef79ce4458c0be7fe85647dc94bfbfd32af5930ab2dbb98118e3361c1a72fec2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-11856",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kaya needed to leave quickly after her release, before her captors discovered she was free.",["title"]="Kaya Flathoof"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6523:description:1-26","6523:description:28-85","6523:description:87-119","6523:description:121-146","6523:description:151-219","6523:objective:1-114"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6523,["sourceHash"]="ef79ce4458c0be7fe85647dc94bfbfd32af5930ab2dbb98118e3361c1a72fec2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11856",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Her father Makaba Flathoof awaited news of her safety; an escort to Camp Aparaje would bring her far enough to find the remaining way herself.",["title"]="Kaya Flathoof"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6542:description:1-46","6542:description:48-185","6542:description:190-275","6542:description:277-348","6542:objective:1-56"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6542,["sourceHash"]="a313e81f2f2d5496970cd5ed192ce7f3989e907cbde26f8ab071364413f8dcb7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11821",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Darn Talongrip recruited support for the Horde’s expanding fronts after a new outpost was established on the Zoram Strand.",["title"]="Darn Talongrip"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6542:description:1-46","6542:description:48-185","6542:description:190-275","6542:description:277-348","6542:objective:1-56"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6542,["sourceHash"]="a313e81f2f2d5496970cd5ed192ce7f3989e907cbde26f8ab071364413f8dcb7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11821",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kadrak directed the Ashenvale campaign from a watch tower in the northern Barrens and could provide further orders.",["title"]="Darn Talongrip"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6604:description:1-57","6604:description:59-147","6604:description:152-252","6604:description:254-292","6604:description:294-304","6604:objective:1-49"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6604,["sourceHash"]="354260fff8a6b83b1af41a126b7b1b1e6a7c3c98077db31fa32d79f80ff5d797"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11755",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Harlo suspected wildkin had destroyed the abandoned southern camp, but knew the details only through its wreckage and rumors.",["title"]="Harlo Wigglesworth"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6604:description:1-57","6604:description:59-147","6604:description:152-252","6604:description:254-292","6604:description:294-304","6604:objective:1-49"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6604,["sourceHash"]="354260fff8a6b83b1af41a126b7b1b1e6a7c3c98077db31fa32d79f80ff5d797"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-11755",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A reported survivor resting in Starfall Village offered the chance to learn what had actually happened.",["title"]="Harlo Wigglesworth"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6608:description:1-30","6608:description:32-44","6608:description:46-74","6608:description:76-95","6608:description:97-112","6608:description:114-139","6608:description:144-223","6608:description:225-245","6608:description:247-253","6608:objective:1-96","6608:objective:98-250"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6608,["sourceHash"]="09927c50e502a9b104e5e1f5fbe714d3de16862f78c60b966417f2e2fdea1082"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3332",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="When a pupil outgrew Lumak’s fishing lessons, he recommended his human friend Nat Pagle for further instruction.",["title"]="Lumak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6608:description:1-30","6608:description:32-44","6608:description:46-74","6608:description:76-95","6608:description:97-112","6608:description:114-139","6608:description:144-223","6608:description:225-245","6608:description:247-253","6608:objective:1-96","6608:objective:98-250"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6608,["sourceHash"]="09927c50e502a9b104e5e1f5fbe714d3de16862f78c60b966417f2e2fdea1082"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-3332",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nat fished in Dustwallow south of Theramore, beyond Lumak’s own teaching grounds.",["title"]="Lumak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6609:description:1-47","6609:description:49-78","6609:description:80-97","6609:description:99-131","6609:description:136-173","6609:description:175-210","6609:description:215-230","6609:description:232-240","6609:description:242-298","6609:description:300-333","6609:description:335-377","6609:description:379-388","6609:objective:1-53","6609:objective:55-119","6609:objective:121-150"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6609,["sourceHash"]="9c0d3aa8fe34203fe7fa02929590a2e3d472df0474adeac8d4e75445a233b3ba"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5161",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Grimnur grumbled that fishing was not what dwarves were made for when admitting that an advanced pupil had learned all he could teach.",["title"]="Grimnur Stonebrand"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6609:description:1-47","6609:description:49-78","6609:description:80-97","6609:description:99-131","6609:description:136-173","6609:description:175-210","6609:description:215-230","6609:description:232-240","6609:description:242-298","6609:description:300-333","6609:description:335-377","6609:description:379-388","6609:objective:1-53","6609:objective:55-119","6609:objective:121-150"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6609,["sourceHash"]="9c0d3aa8fe34203fe7fa02929590a2e3d472df0474adeac8d4e75445a233b3ba"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-5161",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He recommended his old friend Nat Pagle on the islands south of Theramore for the next stage of instruction.",["title"]="Grimnur Stonebrand"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6611:description:1-40","6611:description:42-102","6611:description:107-123","6611:description:125-156","6611:description:158-221","6611:description:226-298","6611:description:300-306","6611:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6611,["sourceHash"]="363d3d576a673f1c53a333fdfef08b5ad8c1f4b4553e53de868dc78ae11ca92c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3399",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Zamja sent an accomplished cooking pupil to Dirge in Gadgetzan when no further lessons remained.",["title"]="Zamja"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6611:description:1-40","6611:description:42-102","6611:description:107-123","6611:description:125-156","6611:description:158-221","6611:description:226-298","6611:description:300-306","6611:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6611,["sourceHash"]="363d3d576a673f1c53a333fdfef08b5ad8c1f4b4553e53de868dc78ae11ca92c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-3399",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The parting request was reciprocal: a pupil who became a great cook should return and teach Zamja in turn.",["title"]="Zamja"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6612:description:1-60","6612:description:62-101","6612:description:106-134","6612:description:136-188","6612:description:193-264","6612:description:266-308","6612:description:310-331","6612:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6612,["sourceHash"]="4dbf050de99da37fc3da6ed4972d62793d7bbff62ec39344cd8ff34927bc4177"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5159",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Daryl Riknussun referred an experienced cook beyond his own teaching to Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan.",["title"]="Daryl Riknussun"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6612:description:1-60","6612:description:62-101","6612:description:106-134","6612:description:136-188","6612:description:193-264","6612:description:266-308","6612:description:310-331","6612:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6612,["sourceHash"]="4dbf050de99da37fc3da6ed4972d62793d7bbff62ec39344cd8ff34927bc4177"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5159",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He considered the goblin perhaps Kalimdor’s finest cook and regarded the long journey as worthwhile for that expertise.",["title"]="Daryl Riknussun"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6623:description:1-21","6623:description:23-56","6623:description:61-95","6623:description:97-213","6623:description:215-258","6623:description:260-349","6623:description:351-383","6623:objective:1-122"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6623,["sourceHash"]="68d39c9f0447bd284c755e3985d9fd4b487a5f5300ff0154b0a4139096ef0733"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="npc-3373",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Arnok passed along Gregory Victor’s invitation to Hammerfall, identifying him as chief physician of Horde Trauma.",["title"]="Arnok"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6623:description:1-21","6623:description:23-56","6623:description:61-95","6623:description:97-213","6623:description:215-258","6623:description:260-349","6623:description:351-383","6623:objective:1-122"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6623,["sourceHash"]="68d39c9f0447bd284c755e3985d9fd4b487a5f5300ff0154b0a4139096ef0733"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="npc-3373",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Arnok himself longed for the opportunity to study under the celebrated doctor and urged that the chance not be wasted.",["title"]="Arnok"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6625:description:1-21","6625:description:23-50","6625:description:55-89","6625:description:91-204","6625:description:206-249","6625:description:251-343","6625:description:345-385","6625:objective:1-126"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6625,["sourceHash"]="9c523daf2fed056efddd4377550908137621071b44e39132c03cad8c301c6ce5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-5150",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nissa relayed Gustaf VanHowzen’s request that a promising doctor join Alliance Trauma at Theramore.",["title"]="Nissa Firestone"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6625:description:1-21","6625:description:23-50","6625:description:55-89","6625:description:91-204","6625:description:206-249","6625:description:251-343","6625:description:345-385","6625:objective:1-126"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6625,["sourceHash"]="9c523daf2fed056efddd4377550908137621071b44e39132c03cad8c301c6ce5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-5150",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="She regarded studying under the chief physician as a rare opportunity she would have valued for herself.",["title"]="Nissa Firestone"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9261:description:1-80","9261:description:82-154","9261:description:161-281","9261:description:283-351","9261:description:353-487","9261:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9261,["sourceHash"]="ed6ed28a1ea93a9347bdde7834f75007e798de2c2bff0d1a92e76b76da437bb4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16484",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="During the Scourge invasion, Lieutenant Nevell organized an investigation of the undead threatening Ironforge.",["title"]="Lieutenant Nevell"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9261:description:1-80","9261:description:82-154","9261:description:161-281","9261:description:283-351","9261:description:353-487","9261:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9261,["sourceHash"]="ed6ed28a1ea93a9347bdde7834f75007e798de2c2bff0d1a92e76b76da437bb4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-16484",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nevell believed the glowing runic circles outside the city were connected to the necropolis and wanted their purpose uncovered.",["title"]="Lieutenant Nevell"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9262:description:1-80","9262:description:82-154","9262:description:161-281","9262:description:283-351","9262:description:353-487","9262:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9262,["sourceHash"]="6740867b166ae51ff290c2203bc80782c21619f66d9360d6d9ee66e02ea18c93"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16495",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lieutenant Beitha sought defenders and investigators when the Scourge threatened Darnassus.",["title"]="Lieutenant Beitha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9262:description:1-80","9262:description:82-154","9262:description:161-281","9262:description:283-351","9262:description:353-487","9262:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9262,["sourceHash"]="6740867b166ae51ff290c2203bc80782c21619f66d9360d6d9ee66e02ea18c93"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-16495",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Beitha suspected the strange circles outside the city shared the power surrounding the invaders and their necropolis.",["title"]="Lieutenant Beitha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9263:description:1-80","9263:description:82-154","9263:description:161-281","9263:description:283-351","9263:description:353-487","9263:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9263,["sourceHash"]="0ebb6696f848b50a7234b13351abc88ec0324b4b0c7f1b7c316e2cd0dcb76be2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16493",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lieutenant Dagel called for resistance to the Scourge assault near Orgrimmar.",["title"]="Lieutenant Dagel"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9263:description:1-80","9263:description:82-154","9263:description:161-281","9263:description:283-351","9263:description:353-487","9263:objective:1-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9263,["sourceHash"]="0ebb6696f848b50a7234b13351abc88ec0324b4b0c7f1b7c316e2cd0dcb76be2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-16493",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dagel wanted the significance of the invaders’ glowing runic circles investigated while their numbers were reduced.",["title"]="Lieutenant Dagel"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9264:description:1-80","9264:description:82-158","9264:description:165-285","9264:description:287-355","9264:description:357-491","9264:objective:1-137"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9264,["sourceHash"]="b3a48f026575c8a545956d69267ebbe329fc63de534197042413c3577b4b684f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16490",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lieutenant Lisande recruited help against the Scourge threatening Thunder Bluff during the invasion.",["title"]="Lieutenant Lisande"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9264:description:1-80","9264:description:82-158","9264:description:165-285","9264:description:287-355","9264:description:357-491","9264:objective:1-137"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9264,["sourceHash"]="b3a48f026575c8a545956d69267ebbe329fc63de534197042413c3577b4b684f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-16490",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The runic circles outside the city seemed tied to the power of the undead and the necropolis overhead.",["title"]="Lieutenant Lisande"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9265:description:1-80","9265:description:82-158","9265:description:165-285","9265:description:287-355","9265:description:357-491","9265:objective:1-137"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9265,["sourceHash"]="ecec7abe069f0bc749db843f43c3f2ba1a249e340c8fe2ea0fd2cb7ef7d52f2b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16494",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lieutenant Rukag sought defenders of the Undercity against the Lich King’s invading undead.",["title"]="Lieutenant Rukag"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9265:description:1-80","9265:description:82-158","9265:description:165-285","9265:description:287-355","9265:description:357-491","9265:objective:1-137"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9265,["sourceHash"]="ecec7abe069f0bc749db843f43c3f2ba1a249e340c8fe2ea0fd2cb7ef7d52f2b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-16494",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rukag wanted both proof that the attackers were being destroyed and an explanation of the strange circles outside the city.",["title"]="Lieutenant Rukag"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9319:description:1-56","9319:description:58-111","9319:description:113-164","9319:description:169-229","9319:description:231-388","9319:objective:1-140"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9319,["sourceHash"]="420bafa87fa68ee8f3840236f3d7ea1c0c8556cf6efcf9b070767011bdf3ff2f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16788",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Festival Flamekeeper guided celebrants seeking Midsummer fires beyond the safety of the capitals.",["title"]="Festival Flamekeeper"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9319:description:1-56","9319:description:58-111","9319:description:113-164","9319:description:169-229","9319:description:231-388","9319:objective:1-140"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9319,["sourceHash"]="420bafa87fa68ee8f3840236f3d7ea1c0c8556cf6efcf9b070767011bdf3ff2f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-16788",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Flamekeeper described fires burning even within Stratholme, Scholomance, Dire Maul’s ogre territory and Blackrock Spire.",["title"]="Festival Flamekeeper"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9367:description:1-32","9367:description:37-135","9367:description:137-274","9367:description:279-328","9367:description:330-398","9367:description:400-475","9367:objective:1-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9367,["sourceHash"]="74bd249127a69a089006446d47e62310378c0caef0b263e7bc2042c0923e89f8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-16817",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Festival Loremaster upheld the custom of choosing Flamekeepers to tend the capital bonfires each Midsummer.",["title"]="Festival Loremaster"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9367:description:1-32","9367:description:37-135","9367:description:137-274","9367:description:279-328","9367:description:330-398","9367:description:400-475","9367:objective:1-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9367,["sourceHash"]="74bd249127a69a089006446d47e62310378c0caef0b263e7bc2042c0923e89f8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-16817",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Loremaster wanted the capital fires inspected, believing their brightness should properly honor the season.",["title"]="Festival Loremaster"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9416:description:1-49","9416:description:51-80","9416:description:82-118","9416:description:123-251","9416:description:256-294","9416:description:296-339","9416:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9416,["sourceHash"]="c23368a6cd14c80d71fe80ea8cda6891784bf140ee61aa9ee1e0fbea21d1ba58"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-17081",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Scout Bloodfist located recruits for General Kirika’s campaign in Silithus rather than training them personally.",["title"]="Scout Bloodfist"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9416:description:1-49","9416:description:51-80","9416:description:82-118","9416:description:123-251","9416:description:256-294","9416:description:296-339","9416:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9416,["sourceHash"]="c23368a6cd14c80d71fe80ea8cda6891784bf140ee61aa9ee1e0fbea21d1ba58"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-17081",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He complained that desert service exhausted bodies quickly while dwarven reinforcements arrived each day.",["title"]="Scout Bloodfist"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9419:description:1-118","9419:description:120-206","9419:description:211-308","9419:description:313-412","9419:objective:1-130"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9419,["sourceHash"]="ab7559d57ca6b8bf22a68fa63a4b3dd3d8820e55505a2d2d222161d6b8bbdc62"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-17080",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Marshal Bluewall admitted the Alliance had underestimated Horde scavenging in Silithus before discovering the resources’ importance.",["title"]="Marshal Bluewall"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9419:description:1-118","9419:description:120-206","9419:description:211-308","9419:description:313-412","9419:objective:1-130"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9419,["sourceHash"]="ab7559d57ca6b8bf22a68fa63a4b3dd3d8820e55505a2d2d222161d6b8bbdc62"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-17080",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bluewall sought help gathering silithyst to make up the ground lost through that initial neglect.",["title"]="Marshal Bluewall"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9422:description:1-85","9422:description:87-210","9422:description:215-286","9422:description:288-378","9422:description:383-426","9422:description:428-447","9422:objective:1-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9422,["sourceHash"]="b44d83be2690bce11f76ddf9c837cc825f1beecad2c91ffdac83781b651b5951"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-17079",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="General Kirika’s forces had tapped Silithus’s crystal resources before Alliance competition intensified.",["title"]="General Kirika"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9422:description:1-85","9422:description:87-210","9422:description:215-286","9422:description:288-378","9422:description:383-426","9422:description:428-447","9422:objective:1-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9422,["sourceHash"]="b44d83be2690bce11f76ddf9c837cc825f1beecad2c91ffdac83781b651b5951"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-17079",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Desert creatures, blowing sand and oppressive heat were joined by a race against the Alliance to secure the same resources.",["title"]="General Kirika"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9664:description:1-31","9664:description:33-135","9664:description:137-273","9664:description:278-373","9664:description:375-428","9664:objective:1-166"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9664,["sourceHash"]="a3bfc6ffbecd29da40df3ed5153a898f93a710b9b8557de398d36b43bf21e7ab"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-17069",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Emmisary Whitebeard supported Alliance plans to seize and rebuild Lordaeron’s abandoned eastern towers as new fortifications.",["title"]="Emmisary Whitebeard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9664:description:1-31","9664:description:33-135","9664:description:137-273","9664:description:278-373","9664:description:375-428","9664:objective:1-166"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9664,["sourceHash"]="a3bfc6ffbecd29da40df3ed5153a898f93a710b9b8557de398d36b43bf21e7ab"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-17069",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The effort was meant to increase pressure on the Forsaken and their allies, whose western foothold the Alliance had failed to dislodge.",["title"]="Emmisary Whitebeard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9665:description:1-146","9665:description:151-299","9665:description:301-456","9665:objective:1-162"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9665,["sourceHash"]="0825938898c4c32a7047bdd5e8b2510dcb87d9d2157d3da832e1ea7a7fb930cf"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-17072",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Emmisary Gormok relayed reports that the Alliance intended to turn abandoned Plaguelands towers into bases.",["title"]="Emmisary Gormok"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"9665:description:1-146","9665:description:151-299","9665:description:301-456","9665:objective:1-162"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=9665,["sourceHash"]="0825938898c4c32a7047bdd5e8b2510dcb87d9d2157d3da832e1ea7a7fb930cf"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-17072",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He sought to expel Alliance forces from occupied towers and hold the others against further attacks on the eastern border.",["title"]="Emmisary Gormok"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6661:description:1-19","6661:description:21-28","6661:description:30-55","6661:description:57-134","6661:description:139-153","6661:description:155-248","6661:description:250-292","6661:description:297-359","6661:description:361-378","6661:description:383-391","6661:objective:1-56","6661:objective:58-85","6661:objective:87-141"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6661,["sourceHash"]="18332a51b2e84f9009351e641eb2c67cbc1d2b3656be755dea49a8f8c5119349"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-12997",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Monty recruited rat catchers in the Deeprun Tram, lending a flute whose melody would draw the vermin after its player.",["title"]="Monty"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6662:description:1-75","6662:description:77-143","6662:description:145-158","6662:description:163-196","6662:description:198-207","6662:description:209-261","6662:description:263-343","6662:objective:1-77"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6662,["sourceHash"]="efa3643568bf1a71b86da4cde4d071d0811550e734fd74c86c0225c4198742d0"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-12997",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="His brother Nipsy ran a rat-kabob business at the other end of the tram and needed the captured rats delivered before they spoiled.",["title"]="Monty"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"922:description:1-82","922:description:85-192","922:description:195-273","922:description:278-291","922:description:294-326","922:description:329-387","922:description:392-479","922:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=922,["sourceHash"]="693e3a6d7fcba38bb94b369fee8f10453406582adec508bc0a6c91f9f3a6a3ff"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1658",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Druids such as Rellian Greenspyre walked the enclave’s pathways, sharing their research into Teldrassil’s troubled timberlings.",["title"]="Cenarion Enclave"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"942:description:1-72","942:description:74-169","942:description:171-237","942:description:242-368","942:description:370-414","942:description:416-461","942:description:466-509","942:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=942,["sourceHash"]="d3f8f9083cfacb1d096164b6d8d4e0dba82ece5e4fbfedf5ea50c7fcb3e4d99f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2104",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The archaeologist Flagongut stayed at the Deepwater Tavern while awaiting an escort to Whelgar’s excavation.",["title"]="Deepwater Tavern"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"945:description:1-5","945:description:10-92","945:description:95-120","945:description:125-152","945:description:155-219","945:description:222-279","945:objective:1-91"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=945,["sourceHash"]="4fa2e99763e993957e30829b749b9429e9d5ef050207b181fc07e764e37d4db7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-416",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The shrine in Ashenvale was where Therysil could receive word that her sister Therylune had escaped the cultists at the Master’s Glaive.",["title"]="The Shrine of Aessina"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"694:description:1-11","694:description:16-98","694:description:100-229","694:description:231-315","694:description:317-402","694:description:407-511","694:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=694,["sourceHash"]="f22f4e0464f2195f2112130b5a7369287d3bf3f9449e13544f835e2db2f4f20d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2570",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Boulderfist shamans had taken gems from the Tower of Arathor; Kryten could enchant one to serve as a key to its defenses.",["title"]="Boulderfist Shaman"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"713:description:1-110","713:description:115-203","713:description:205-276","713:description:281-426","713:description:431-489","713:description:491-506","713:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=713,["sourceHash"]="421ee5a4ee161fce7754da60fb0951237db7cd5d51a71e82456ca4241af3d4b1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2480",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bro’kin, a goblin in Alterac, knew how to prepare Frost Oil, valued for cooling machinery and helping enchantments endure.",["title"]="Bro'kin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"782:description:1-189","782:description:191-263","782:description:268-401","782:description:403-473","782:description:475-507","782:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=782,["sourceHash"]="fe3a435c5dbb9be5d3a7ee9961238c11389fb4b89f285d6540cefee5bb3b57a4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-2757",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Blacklash had served Deathwing as a lieutenant before imprisonment with Hematus in Lethlor Ravine.",["title"]="Blacklash"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"793:description:1-120","793:description:122-225","793:description:230-315","793:description:317-362","793:description:367-434","793:description:437-498","793:objective:1-107","793:objective:112-187","793:objective:192-291"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=793,["sourceHash"]="8551feac293f7d20c1ff697d5b704254063759bee90f5e5403cf43056a21deee"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2757",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Three runestones in the Pillars of Diamond, Opal and Amethyst maintained the Seal of the Earth that held the two drakes.",["title"]="Blacklash"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"782:description:1-189","782:description:191-263","782:description:268-401","782:description:403-473","782:description:475-507","782:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=782,["sourceHash"]="fe3a435c5dbb9be5d3a7ee9961238c11389fb4b89f285d6540cefee5bb3b57a4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-2759",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hematus was one of Deathwing’s lieutenants known to the Horde from its alliance with the dragon during the Second War.",["title"]="Hematus"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"717:description:1-105","717:description:107-260","717:description:265-372","717:description:374-446","717:description:457-493","717:objective:1-107","717:objective:112-187","717:objective:192-292"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=717,["sourceHash"]="1d403236a428e8f3d95dc1d9bad3b05ba52c671166adad959edafb332dd800e6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2759",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hematus and Blacklash remained imprisoned in Lethlor, but black dragons settling nearby and the theft of the Sign of the Earth made their captivity seem insecure.",["title"]="Hematus"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"722:description:1-14","722:description:16-25","722:description:27-58","722:description:63-93","722:description:95-116","722:description:118-127","722:description:129-150","722:description:152-161","722:description:166-187","722:description:189-208","722:description:210-228","722:description:230-251","722:description:253-278","722:description:280-289","722:description:292-332","722:description:334-352","722:description:354-362","722:description:364-379","722:description:384-460","722:description:462-476","722:description:478-503","722:objective:1-56"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=722,["sourceHash"]="55301e94d63dab63c94ce04d0e4cfa40a4593fde9c83deee502640c9dc73bb8f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-2932",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hammertoe accused Magregan Deepshadow of holding his amulet within Uldaman and feared it would guide the Dark Irons to scrolls useful for stronger golems.",["title"]="Magregan Deepshadow"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"725:description:1-55","725:description:57-126","725:description:128-162","725:description:167-235","725:description:237-347","725:description:349-365","725:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=725,["sourceHash"]="78d35b8169f360ee79547f7dc2cf11b2516bb05e5bbca3b410f5212b92048294"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2915",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hammertoe’s spirit remained a possible source of knowledge about the Shadowforge operation after news of the danger was sent to Advisor Belgrum.",["title"]="Hammertoe's Spirit"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"739:description:1-35","739:description:38-137","739:description:142-158","739:description:163-258","739:description:263-298","739:objective:1-31","739:objective:36-67","739:objective:72-115"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=739,["sourceHash"]="609be351ad08c2d4d584134c4f2050f68c4d7c153a130bc900c757ee7fd8e33c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-2945",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Agmond’s last trace named Murdaloc: the dying dwarf had scrawled the name in sandstone beside his bloodied hand. The ensuing charge identified Murdaloc as his killer.",["title"]="Murdaloc"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"742:description:1-29","742:description:32-64","742:description:69-146","742:description:149-251","742:description:254-317","742:description:320-469","742:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=742,["sourceHash"]="7e9249ad0e78b69bbab7dbd3894e9c957abd421d889eed0bac5116e5603b3c27"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-12696",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Senani Thunderheart organized a great hunt from Splintertree Post, welcoming adventurers seeking to prove themselves in Ashenvale.",["title"]="Senani Thunderheart"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"750:description:1-84","750:description:86-146","750:description:148-258","750:description:260-317","750:description:322-375","750:objective:1-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=750,["sourceHash"]="08405d02283ce4d6fbba0d5cb17c610e230e9581ae03abd2bae4ed3e996b2086"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-2961",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mountain cougars lurked in the hills south of Camp Narache.",["title"]="Mountain Cougar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"750:description:1-84","750:description:86-146","750:description:148-258","750:description:260-317","750:description:322-375","750:objective:1-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=750,["sourceHash"]="08405d02283ce4d6fbba0d5cb17c610e230e9581ae03abd2bae4ed3e996b2086"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2961",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their pelts supplied more than trophies: the camp needed them to clothe children and mend tents.",["title"]="Mountain Cougar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"759:description:1-75","759:description:78-178","759:description:181-255","759:description:260-329","759:objective:1-69"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=759,["sourceHash"]="edadd696e04b9e01d7ac8f1b6353d08c50767f49feab92a18f4985c65a684cf5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-2960",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Prairie wolf alphas ranged north of Bloodhoof Village and around the base of Thunder Bluff.",["title"]="Prairie Wolf Alpha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"759:description:1-75","759:description:78-178","759:description:181-255","759:description:260-329","759:objective:1-69"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=759,["sourceHash"]="edadd696e04b9e01d7ac8f1b6353d08c50767f49feab92a18f4985c65a684cf5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2960",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mull Thunderhorn sought the fierce predators’ teeth as the land’s offering for cleansing the Wildmane well.",["title"]="Prairie Wolf Alpha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"762:description:1-125","762:description:130-221","762:description:223-314","762:description:319-341","762:description:343-397","762:description:399-482","762:description:487-510","762:objective:1-104"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=762,["sourceHash"]="a758654bcf56b2f376de9435a17482782aca4e62a820392bd2685a8f1ca4ac5e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2745",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ragnaros sent Ambassador Infernus to Angor Fortress to oversee the Shadowforge search for lost Uldaman artifacts.",["title"]="Ambassador Infernus"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"762:description:1-125","762:description:130-221","762:description:223-314","762:description:319-341","762:description:343-397","762:description:399-482","762:description:487-510","762:objective:1-104"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=762,["sourceHash"]="a758654bcf56b2f376de9435a17482782aca4e62a820392bd2685a8f1ca4ac5e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-2745",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Historian Karnik feared those discoveries would strengthen the Dark Irons against Ironforge, after the search had already cost dwarven lives.",["title"]="Ambassador Infernus"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"765:description:1-73","765:description:75-193","765:description:198-279","765:description:281-328","765:description:330-401","765:description:403-435","765:description:437-504","765:objective:1-96"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=765,["sourceHash"]="3693db2505943a0c608a3ef03a71694558d3fe523773eaa16670ecfde840a9f6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3051",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Supervisor Fizsprocket was identified as the planner behind the Venture Co.’s efforts to drive the tauren from their lands.",["title"]="Supervisor Fizsprocket"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"765:description:1-73","765:description:75-193","765:description:198-279","765:description:281-328","765:description:330-401","765:description:403-435","765:description:437-504","765:objective:1-96"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=765,["sourceHash"]="3693db2505943a0c608a3ef03a71694558d3fe523773eaa16670ecfde840a9f6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3051",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Morin Cloudstalker placed Fizsprocket in the Venture Co. mine east of the ravaged caravan and sought his clipboard for further evidence.",["title"]="Supervisor Fizsprocket"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"766:description:1-82","766:description:84-156","766:description:161-281","766:description:283-329","766:description:331-476","766:description:481-510","766:objective:1-128"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=766,["sourceHash"]="8b1bd0e7ce521c71846b12932d7f7b11ad99b8cf028dd259263ab06c4daf87ff"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-3068",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Maur Raincaller described Mazzranache’s glaring red eyes and razor-sharp talons, recalling the same fearsome features from his grandfather’s stories.",["title"]="Mazzranache"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"766:description:1-82","766:description:84-156","766:description:161-281","766:description:283-329","766:description:331-476","766:description:481-510","766:objective:1-128"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=766,["sourceHash"]="8b1bd0e7ce521c71846b12932d7f7b11ad99b8cf028dd259263ab06c4daf87ff"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-3068",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mazzranache bit Maur’s shoulder while he crossed the plains, leaving an infection that required an urgent remedy.",["title"]="Mazzranache"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"766:description:1-82","766:description:84-156","766:description:161-281","766:description:283-329","766:description:331-476","766:description:481-510","766:objective:1-128","766:completion:1-18","766:completion:20-166","766:completion:168-195","766:completion:200-316","766:completion:321-344"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=766,["sourceHash"]="8b1bd0e7ce521c71846b12932d7f7b11ad99b8cf028dd259263ab06c4daf87ff"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3068",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Maur remembered a screeching call and a flash of color as the strider’s beak descended; the remedy’s ingredients gave him hope of stopping the infection.",["title"]="Mazzranache"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"817:description:1-54","817:description:56-183","817:description:188-243","817:description:245-314","817:description:316-381","817:description:386-439","817:description:441-487","817:objective:1-62"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=817,["sourceHash"]="acd3602220689d3291ea5b429d6902d0b77b81b7d76b3ef57c65d48d3b2a1de5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3121",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Vel’rin Fang directed hunts for Durotar tigers toward the islands south of his post.",["title"]="Durotar Tiger"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"817:description:1-54","817:description:56-183","817:description:188-243","817:description:245-314","817:description:316-381","817:description:386-439","817:description:441-487","817:objective:1-62"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=817,["sourceHash"]="acd3602220689d3291ea5b429d6902d0b77b81b7d76b3ef57c65d48d3b2a1de5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3121",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their hides furnished blankets, armor and tents. Growing demand encouraged a controlled hunt rather than the destruction of the beasts that sustained it.",["title"]="Durotar Tiger"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6662:description:1-75","6662:description:77-143","6662:description:145-158","6662:description:163-196","6662:description:198-207","6662:description:209-261","6662:description:263-343","6662:objective:1-77"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6662,["sourceHash"]="efa3643568bf1a71b86da4cde4d071d0811550e734fd74c86c0225c4198742d0"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-13018",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nipsy made rat kabobs at the Stormwind end of the Deeprun Tram and relied on Monty’s catches to supply the business.",["title"]="Nipsy"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6662:description:1-75","6662:description:77-143","6662:description:145-158","6662:description:163-196","6662:description:198-207","6662:description:209-261","6662:description:263-343","6662:objective:1-77","6662:completion:1-11","6662:completion:13-72","6662:completion:74-155","6662:completion:160-173","6662:completion:178-233"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=6662,["sourceHash"]="efa3643568bf1a71b86da4cde4d071d0811550e734fd74c86c0225c4198742d0"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-13018",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nipsy described Monty as his brother, explaining that the Gnomeregan disaster had changed him; despite Monty’s pirate talk, Nipsy said he had never seen the sea.",["title"]="Nipsy"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"782:description:1-189","782:description:191-263","782:description:268-401","782:description:403-473","782:description:475-507","782:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=782,["sourceHash"]="fe3a435c5dbb9be5d3a7ee9961238c11389fb4b89f285d6540cefee5bb3b57a4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-339",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Deathwing’s former lieutenants Blacklash and Hematus were held in the ravine, their prison protected by the Sign of the Earth.",["title"]="Lethlor Ravine"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"717:description:1-105","717:description:107-260","717:description:265-372","717:description:374-446","717:description:457-493","717:objective:1-107","717:objective:112-187","717:objective:192-292"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=717,["sourceHash"]="1d403236a428e8f3d95dc1d9bad3b05ba52c671166adad959edafb332dd800e6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-339",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The arrival of black dragons and the theft of the prison’s key raised doubts about whether the captive drakes could remain contained.",["title"]="Lethlor Ravine"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"923:description:1-50","923:description:53-190","923:description:193-270","923:description:273-293","923:description:298-383","923:description:386-435","923:objective:1-56"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=923,["sourceHash"]="8cbbd2a1a722ba2c95d43464efeb99a3907b71e95fa6ee97c0dc75d7cbe782a9"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-266",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rellian Greenspyre considered the timberlings around this northern Teldrassil lake the most deeply tainted, bearing mossy tumors he wanted removed and burned.",["title"]="Wellspring Lake"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"929:description:1-58","929:description:60-186","929:description:188-268","929:description:273-403","929:description:405-491","929:objective:1-72"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=929,["sourceHash"]="2decdd2f207e21b84d0f8afd3d471a4ecae426e70d7ae78278ddf6145f14be15"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-260",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Water from the moonwell outside Starbreeze Village helped replenish the druids’ well in Darnassus, carried in specially crafted vessels.",["title"]="Starbreeze Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"933:description:1-107","933:description:109-240","933:description:245-314","933:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=933,["sourceHash"]="5b14c6a4f868f276f7f188502eb28bdb53b255c7e34dbc1870368f82292dc711"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="pools-of-arlithrien",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A moonwell stood on the pools’ shores, southeast of the entrance to Darnassus.",["title"]="Pools of Arlithrien"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"933:description:1-107","933:description:109-240","933:description:245-314","933:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=933,["sourceHash"]="5b14c6a4f868f276f7f188502eb28bdb53b255c7e34dbc1870368f82292dc711"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="pools-of-arlithrien",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Growing Gnarlpine aggression made Sentinel patrols around the well increasingly difficult.",["title"]="Pools of Arlithrien"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"934:description:1-42","934:description:44-234","934:description:239-276","934:description:278-348","934:description:350-431","934:description:433-479","934:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=934,["sourceHash"]="2c50ed0b1042f32ab8d4d3b6e89dddc3a1a235a0ee9e09df053192967815212a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-264",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Beneath the Oracle Tree’s boughs lay the first and most powerful of Teldrassil’s moonwells, according to the account of the water-gathering pilgrimage.",["title"]="The Oracle Glade"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"991:description:1-103","991:description:108-242","991:description:247-310","991:description:315-428","991:description:430-480","991:description:485-511","991:objective:1-26"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=991,["sourceHash"]="445f7d6761fbf3e74ac465a73471d402236e96e64c99d9bd07aeca828fc25a57"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-441",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A shrine at the lake once guarded a gem sought for the rod of the dead wizard Dartol. Teronis went there after the site had been overrun.",["title"]="Lake Falathim"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"992:description:1-117","992:description:122-206","992:description:209-300","992:description:305-393","992:description:396-442","992:description:445-496","992:objective:1-75","992:objective:78-191"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=992,["sourceHash"]="862dfe2f6daf4c3f37b5d27b08a2ed55b6b4024d32a0a0872605727981f8319a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-979",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A pool near Sandsorrow Watch drew the Gadgetzan Water Company’s interest as nomads seized its wells; a dowsing sample might reveal another supply.",["title"]="Sandsorrow Watch"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1010:description:1-81","1010:description:84-164","1010:description:169-260","1010:description:263-326","1010:description:329-370","1010:description:375-461","1010:objective:1-57"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1010,["sourceHash"]="46c7f301dfa8140a2ca9bf01067888b782974fdf1cdf4f05f52ba9def8d12883"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-411",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The old ruins lay north of Maestra’s Post, just short of the Darkshore border.",["title"]="Bathran's Haunt"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1010:description:1-81","1010:description:84-164","1010:description:169-260","1010:description:263-326","1010:description:329-370","1010:description:375-461","1010:objective:1-57"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1010,["sourceHash"]="46c7f301dfa8140a2ca9bf01067888b782974fdf1cdf4f05f52ba9def8d12883"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-411",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bathran’s Hair once grew among the ruins, a plant valued for treating ailments of the spirit.",["title"]="Bathran's Haunt"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1022:description:1-143","1022:description:145-214","1022:description:219-333","1022:description:335-405","1022:description:407-502","1022:objective:1-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-419",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The ruined shrine of Mel’Thandris lay near the Felwood border in northern Ashenvale.",["title"]="The Howling Vale"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1022:description:1-143","1022:description:145-214","1022:description:219-333","1022:description:335-405","1022:description:407-502","1022:objective:1-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1022,["sourceHash"]="4fe69627c8f14167520b33490bfb87409d6131fc422eb44d1b15ac13bf105937"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-419",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Wolf-men had occupied the shrine; their unnerving cries gave the surrounding vale its name. Its surviving tome offered a possible explanation of their arrival.",["title"]="The Howling Vale"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1039:description:1-40","1039:description:42-137","1039:description:139-300","1039:description:305-390","1039:description:392-450","1039:description:452-488","1039:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1039,["sourceHash"]="9453950ade5e0e5d1bb72cec7c4266a46fd4d239c08243bce5e9904270c84f88"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-7",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ships trading from Ratchet crossed to Blackwater Cove; investigators of Velinde’s disappearance considered such a vessel her likely route, rather than a confirmed passage.",["title"]="Blackwater Cove"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1033:description:1-109","1033:description:112-147","1033:description:150-234","1033:description:239-341","1033:description:344-394","1033:description:396-470","1033:objective:1-44"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1033,["sourceHash"]="a8aa3e76b0a64cf96dbe02f974fc86df0abe4df87fc83ccd3d851dde361e2264"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="iris-lake",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The isle in Iris Lake was the only reported source of Elune’s Tear, a stone Orendil recommended as a stronger remedy for corruption.",["title"]="Iris Lake"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1017:description:1-91","1017:description:93-137","1017:description:139-221","1017:description:226-289","1017:description:291-389","1017:description:394-427","1017:description:429-478","1017:objective:1-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1017,["sourceHash"]="a3b66ebe9d2772b351cac6a9363b994027504ceb107a35b24adb3d1063e7757f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-384",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sentinel suspicions placed the undead mage Sarilus Foulborne atop Dreadmist Peak, blaming him for the defilement of numerous water elementals.",["title"]="Dreadmist Peak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1017:description:1-91","1017:description:93-137","1017:description:139-221","1017:description:226-289","1017:description:291-389","1017:description:394-427","1017:description:429-478","1017:objective:1-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1017,["sourceHash"]="a3b66ebe9d2772b351cac6a9363b994027504ceb107a35b24adb3d1063e7757f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3986",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sarilus Foulborne was an undead mage in the Barrens, blamed by the Sentinels for corrupting the water elementals.",["title"]="Sarilus Foulborne"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1017:description:1-91","1017:description:93-137","1017:description:139-221","1017:description:226-289","1017:description:291-389","1017:description:394-427","1017:description:429-478","1017:objective:1-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1017,["sourceHash"]="a3b66ebe9d2772b351cac6a9363b994027504ceb107a35b24adb3d1063e7757f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3986",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="His accuser expected to find him atop Dreadmist Peak, within territory where Horde patrols posed another danger to the search.",["title"]="Sarilus Foulborne"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1037:description:1-61","1037:description:63-171","1037:description:173-204","1037:description:209-245","1037:description:247-298","1037:description:300-438","1037:description:443-500","1037:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1037,["sourceHash"]="8a2b7b425fcbaf37a149d166158bae0a8c952bcf77356c4d2447c87d9807966d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-3946",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Velinde Starsong had directed the effort against Felwood’s corruption before her progress faltered and she disappeared, leaving a successor to continue the work.",["title"]="Velinde Starsong"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1038:description:1-41","1038:description:43-121","1038:description:123-219","1038:description:221-311","1038:description:316-443","1038:description:445-502","1038:objective:1-119"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1038,["sourceHash"]="17d1e5b45f1d06b1944c1a607131a3a6b29cb67a1adee68e28568f4c6a73dbf8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3946",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Her possessions remained in the Sentinels’ bunkhouse, including a journal of her duties. The Sentinels believed she might return and continued to trust her motives.",["title"]="Velinde Starsong"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1041:description:1-80","1041:description:85-151","1041:description:153-290","1041:description:295-353","1041:description:355-397","1041:description:399-426","1041:description:431-503","1041:objective:1-37"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1041,["sourceHash"]="c41f436fb1f317d3596d95d1e65f87acc12f4e8ef63957f81a0c45574e0037d0"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-3946",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A caravan master remembered Velinde traveling with his company and parting from it on the northern road toward Darkshire.",["title"]="Velinde Starsong"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1045:description:1-82","1045:description:84-117","1045:description:119-157","1045:description:162-234","1045:description:236-292","1045:description:297-328","1045:description:330-353","1045:description:355-396","1045:description:398-497","1045:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1045,["sourceHash"]="9de7025283bc4846e90bdc9c1370417d57222ac77dd3293285ddb19d185c48ea"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-3696",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Krolg described Ran Bloodtooth as power-hungry even before corruption strengthened him, warning that the furbolgs bore responsibility for their own cruelty.",["title"]="Ran Bloodtooth"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1045:description:1-82","1045:description:84-117","1045:description:119-157","1045:description:162-234","1045:description:236-292","1045:description:297-328","1045:description:330-353","1045:description:355-396","1045:description:398-497","1045:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1045,["sourceHash"]="9de7025283bc4846e90bdc9c1370417d57222ac77dd3293285ddb19d185c48ea"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3696",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Krolg’s hatred of the elves did not extend to wishing harm on their children; opposing Ran was, for him, a duty to restrain his own people.",["title"]="Ran Bloodtooth"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1051:description:1-63","1051:description:65-109","1051:description:111-137","1051:description:142-176","1051:description:178-199","1051:description:201-245","1051:description:247-258","1051:description:263-272","1051:description:274-288","1051:description:293-380","1051:description:382-473","1051:description:478-500","1051:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1051,["sourceHash"]="aaaea25f5d1a6fcc8a71086f84e109cd81d62ddbcfdff82b8afa7ffbc4e03676"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-3984",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Vorrel Sengutz identified Nancy as Interrogator Vishas’s wife and accused Vishas of giving her the wedding ring taken during his torture.",["title"]="Nancy Vishas"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1051:description:1-63","1051:description:65-109","1051:description:111-137","1051:description:142-176","1051:description:178-199","1051:description:201-245","1051:description:247-258","1051:description:263-272","1051:description:274-288","1051:description:293-380","1051:description:382-473","1051:description:478-500","1051:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1051,["sourceHash"]="aaaea25f5d1a6fcc8a71086f84e109cd81d62ddbcfdff82b8afa7ffbc4e03676"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3984",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Vishas had boasted that Nancy lived along Lake Lordamere, according to Vorrel’s account.",["title"]="Nancy Vishas"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1051:description:1-63","1051:description:65-109","1051:description:111-137","1051:description:142-176","1051:description:178-199","1051:description:201-245","1051:description:247-258","1051:description:263-272","1051:description:274-288","1051:description:293-380","1051:description:382-473","1051:description:478-500","1051:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1051,["sourceHash"]="aaaea25f5d1a6fcc8a71086f84e109cd81d62ddbcfdff82b8afa7ffbc4e03676"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-3982",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Monika Sengutz was Vorrel’s wife in Tarren Mill, the intended recipient of the wedding ring he wanted recovered from Nancy Vishas.",["title"]="Monika Sengutz"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1058:description:1-16","1058:description:21-62","1058:description:64-121","1058:description:123-156","1058:description:158-180","1058:description:182-194","1058:description:199-238","1058:description:240-298","1058:description:300-378","1058:description:380-438","1058:description:443-504","1058:objective:1-131"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1058,["sourceHash"]="00208a292c981783160c8c0638f7c134da98bbc3cc3443d91b8ba2bcf5c69b59"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-4016",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Fey dragons around Stonetalon Peak were sought for scales used in Jin’Zil’s forest-magic preparation.",["title"]="Fey Dragon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1076:description:1-22","1076:description:24-43","1076:description:45-89","1076:description:94-155","1076:description:157-202","1076:description:207-315","1076:description:317-447","1076:description:452-480","1076:objective:1-54"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1076,["sourceHash"]="a6022f4621cffa6d188abcb9cf3b458a0faa13d16b5d3d86b5546745fe8614af"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-832",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Debris from Westfall’s dust devils could serve as a component for a scroll carrying a messaging enchantment.",["title"]="Dust Devil"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1190:description:1-110","1190:description:112-248","1190:description:253-366","1190:description:371-452","1190:objective:1-92"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1190,["sourceHash"]="7a4fe54bc982df875581e0cfa4dffb072ef768dddb1ba03f750b83f9969d57ab"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4720",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rizzle Brassbolts devoted himself to plans for a discovery that rivals suspected explained the Brassbolts cars’ improved speed, despite apparently unchanged designs.",["title"]="Rizzle Brassbolts"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1190:description:1-110","1190:description:112-248","1190:description:253-366","1190:description:371-452","1190:objective:1-92"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1190,["sourceHash"]="7a4fe54bc982df875581e0cfa4dffb072ef768dddb1ba03f750b83f9969d57ab"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-4720",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The competing team proposed using Zamek’s diversion to steal those plans; its new-material theory remained an inference from the racing results.",["title"]="Rizzle Brassbolts"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1120:description:1-56","1120:description:59-157","1120:description:162-185","1120:description:188-221","1120:objective:1-45"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1120,["sourceHash"]="47c71c333cafad5be4189983ffdd05bc46e1a9634db91e49e51ac4ffd5803711"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4495",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The gnome pit boss was selected as a possible test subject for Fool’s Stout, a brew that would spoil if left too long.",["title"]="Gnome Pit Boss"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1121:description:1-56","1121:description:59-159","1121:description:164-187","1121:description:190-223","1121:objective:1-46"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1121,["sourceHash"]="c439a835bd357a7ed32c41b28b24f4465a20e99efb7d5d499e506923ed85c3e5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4496",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The goblin pit boss was a proposed recipient for the trial of Fool’s Stout on a racing pit crew.",["title"]="Goblin Pit Boss"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1195:description:1-109","1195:description:114-214","1195:description:219-370","1195:description:372-490","1195:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1195,["sourceHash"]="78ed8423acff3f1b4a13ca435cc91b7ca7ffc1ac6555d46733db0dac927b5550"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2967",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Galak centaur in Thousand Needles guarded a relic said to date from their people’s creation.",["title"]="Galak Centaur"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1197:description:1-106","1197:description:108-184","1197:description:189-265","1197:description:267-338","1197:description:343-473","1197:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1197,["sourceHash"]="125b9cae3c52fda7b9852f556fa0f66bc5dd2c740f3315f54491deaa96bca7f4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-2967",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their forces held Splithoof Crag and its heavily guarded hold, where a flame protected the treasured relic.",["title"]="Galak Centaur"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1205:description:1-53","1205:description:56-81","1205:description:86-300","1205:description:305-349","1205:description:352-400","1205:description:403-434","1205:objective:1-49"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1205,["sourceHash"]="bed6eaed14a20ee794ba346d182a332dfa3eadae2694faaa314c9523cc21594b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-4841",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Deadmire was an ancient crocolisk whose enormous body moved through Dustwallow’s swamp with youthful strength despite the grinding of aged bones.",["title"]="Deadmire"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1205:description:1-53","1205:description:56-81","1205:description:86-300","1205:description:305-349","1205:description:352-400","1205:description:403-434","1205:objective:1-49"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1205,["sourceHash"]="bed6eaed14a20ee794ba346d182a332dfa3eadae2694faaa314c9523cc21594b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4841",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The spirit within him was described as undiminished, but his failing body caused constant pain; the request to end his life was presented as mercy.",["title"]="Deadmire"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1266:description:1-38","1266:description:40-128","1266:description:130-249","1266:description:254-332","1266:description:337-412","1266:description:414-492","1266:objective:1-40"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1266,["sourceHash"]="c05b16ef5e646d7834a12ab71f82b89acfd46a3bb40a1f36081c6b3177850a4a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4966",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Private Hendel guarded resting Theramore infiltrators in roadside tents west of the settlement; they had been watching Brackenwall and other threats to the border.",["title"]="Private Hendel"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1362:description:1-83","1362:description:86-154","1362:description:159-240","1362:description:243-285","1362:description:290-348","1362:description:351-400","1362:description:403-460","1362:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1362,["sourceHash"]="c34b4867ac6845fe48dca13dee98ad39fdc87d0b51801f4d072bb75bb0ae8691"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-4632",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Kolkar’s strength lay in Desolace, with forces also spreading into the Barrens.",["title"]="Kolkar Centaur"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1362:description:1-83","1362:description:86-154","1362:description:159-240","1362:description:243-285","1362:description:290-348","1362:description:351-400","1362:description:403-460","1362:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1362,["sourceHash"]="c34b4867ac6845fe48dca13dee98ad39fdc87d0b51801f4d072bb75bb0ae8691"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-4632",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Horde observers regarded the Desolace foothold as a continuing threat even while agents confronted the Kolkar farther east.",["title"]="Kolkar Centaur"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1364:description:1-115","1364:description:120-168","1364:description:170-197","1364:description:202-320","1364:description:322-362","1364:description:364-399","1364:description:401-436","1364:description:441-503","1364:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1364,["sourceHash"]="793d17d312e44aa645678c0e0033ae05d7c4bb6df1784009d922867df715df4e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5385",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Watcher Mahar Ba at Nethergarde Keep awaited an important essay from Master Mazen; its courier lost it after taking a wrong turn among the Swamp of Sorrows’ plant-like creatures.",["title"]="Watcher Mahar Ba"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1395:description:1-80","1395:description:83-164","1395:description:169-219","1395:description:224-280","1395:description:283-422","1395:description:427-442","1395:description:445-507","1395:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1395,["sourceHash"]="cf5c6ab99af950a1deaaba09e671b0338631cec1e05cb4a3145c697b923b5836"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5393",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Quartermaster Lungertz received supplies for Nethergarde Keep, including powerstones that required urgent delivery before their charge faded.",["title"]="Quartermaster Lungertz"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1423:description:1-32","1423:description:35-82","1423:description:85-134","1423:description:139-160","1423:description:165-180","1423:objective:1-50"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1423,["sourceHash"]="cfbeb30aad313ca606d05c96906a3c7cd3d1cf071cb11241f724f3ffd40f6fff"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5393",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A lost supply barrel bore Lungertz’s name and Nethergarde’s destination stamp; yellow, pungent wax sealed its seams.",["title"]="Quartermaster Lungertz"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1365:description:1-48","1365:description:51-124","1365:description:127-206","1365:description:209-269","1365:description:274-314","1365:description:319-364","1365:description:367-412","1365:description:417-456","1365:description:459-490","1365:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1365,["sourceHash"]="972a58414043949ba63f186869c854cfbba6caa830ae35540f2e74d83c7e62e4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5600",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Khan Dez’hepah led Desolace’s Kolkar clan. His enemies proposed killing him to disrupt the centaur before their rival clans could unite.",["title"]="Khan Dez'hepah"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1375:description:1-36","1375:description:39-71","1375:description:74-111","1375:description:114-158","1375:objective:1-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1375,["sourceHash"]="ead68e4ad8c709c014478f2632e450bd4c8455b2e390aa619edc7e137469dcaf"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5602",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Khan Shaka led the Gelkis and became the target of a Magram demand for his head as the clan rivalry intensified.",["title"]="Khan Shaka"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1380:description:1-37","1380:description:40-71","1380:description:74-114","1380:description:119-159","1380:description:162-209","1380:description:214-270","1380:description:273-330","1380:description:335-377","1380:description:380-410","1380:description:415-447","1380:description:449-454","1380:description:457-473","1380:objective:1-119"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1380,["sourceHash"]="822fdb9ee982701ab75d9ef55da0a751b0775f1fc807a002fb3116a68164d37e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5402",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Khan Hratha led the Maraudine and held a piece of the key coveted by their rivals.",["title"]="Khan Hratha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1380:description:1-37","1380:description:40-71","1380:description:74-114","1380:description:119-159","1380:description:162-209","1380:description:214-270","1380:description:273-330","1380:description:335-377","1380:description:380-410","1380:description:415-447","1380:description:449-454","1380:description:457-473","1380:objective:1-119"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1380,["sourceHash"]="822fdb9ee982701ab75d9ef55da0a751b0775f1fc807a002fb3116a68164d37e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5402",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The war horn high in the Valley of Spears could call Maraudine defenders and eventually Hratha, but only a rare mouthpiece carried by trusted centaur would sound it.",["title"]="Khan Hratha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1383:description:1-36","1383:description:38-117","1383:description:122-198","1383:description:200-274","1383:description:276-344","1383:description:349-425","1383:description:427-484","1383:description:489-504","1383:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1383,["sourceHash"]="0fecf4725a0802a60f04c94818564d91c71e0370dee02e7961541a2aa0cc1d51"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1081",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Apothecary Faustin sought enchanted fungus from the Mire Lord in the Swamp of Sorrows for a truth-altering serum.",["title"]="Mire Lord"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1383:description:1-36","1383:description:38-117","1383:description:122-198","1383:description:200-274","1383:description:276-344","1383:description:349-425","1383:description:427-484","1383:description:489-504","1383:objective:1-110"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1383,["sourceHash"]="0fecf4725a0802a60f04c94818564d91c71e0370dee02e7961541a2aa0cc1d51"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-768",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Shadow panthers of the Swamp of Sorrows supplied hearts sought for Apothecary Faustin’s serum.",["title"]="Shadow Panther"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1094:description:1-92","1094:description:94-162","1094:description:164-214","1094:description:219-280","1094:description:282-349","1094:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1094,["sourceHash"]="9571c31a15494153ab6ab006c5cf9351db787f09c059ebb057348569f7f7f2c8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-3442",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sputtervalve was described to a prospective visitor as a small, green fellow living in Ratchet.",["title"]="Sputtervalve"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1064:description:1-85","1064:description:88-162","1064:description:167-230","1064:description:233-258","1064:description:261-353","1064:description:358-385","1064:description:388-436","1064:description:439-501","1064:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1064,["sourceHash"]="8911865c385b1511b9287748f46c036ea2fdfb4da70f5e0b6b566761b008a99f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2197",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Pools of Vision lay below Thunder Bluff’s Spirit Rise.",["title"]="The Pools of Vision"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1064:description:1-85","1064:description:88-162","1064:description:167-230","1064:description:233-258","1064:description:261-353","1064:description:358-385","1064:description:388-436","1064:description:439-501","1064:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1064,["sourceHash"]="8911865c385b1511b9287748f46c036ea2fdfb4da70f5e0b6b566761b008a99f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2197",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Apothecary Zamah worked there as a Forsaken scholar and emissary; Magatha hoped her knowledge of disease could aid the wounded Stonetalon lands and strengthen trust between their peoples.",["title"]="The Pools of Vision"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1069:description:1-48","1069:description:51-67","1069:description:69-92","1069:description:97-119","1069:description:124-232","1069:description:235-274","1069:description:279-348","1069:description:353-371","1069:description:373-469","1069:objective:1-52"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1069,["sourceHash"]="9d341367f81e3e4fcb487aefe25c92b11b40c6c051ea6d31298cb8a71437c258"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2541",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Deepmoss spiders nested in the canyon. Their eggs drew commercial interest when spider-egg omelettes became fashionable in Booty Bay.",["title"]="Sishir Canyon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1197:description:1-106","1197:description:108-184","1197:description:189-265","1197:description:267-338","1197:description:343-473","1197:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1197,["sourceHash"]="125b9cae3c52fda7b9852f556fa0f66bc5dd2c740f3315f54491deaa96bca7f4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1557",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The heavily guarded hold protected the Galak’s ancient relic beneath a flame that moonwell water could suppress only briefly.",["title"]="Splithoof Hold"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1197:description:1-106","1197:description:108-184","1197:description:189-265","1197:description:267-338","1197:description:343-473","1197:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1197,["sourceHash"]="125b9cae3c52fda7b9852f556fa0f66bc5dd2c740f3315f54491deaa96bca7f4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-481",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Splithoof Crag was the Galak centaurs’ stronghold, with their protected relic kept farther within Splithoof Hold.",["title"]="Splithoof Crag"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1367:description:1-59","1367:description:62-156","1367:description:161-231","1367:description:234-277","1367:description:280-406","1367:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1367,["sourceHash"]="38e7fe5819cfe974b47081526a8b246d6b2217efaabb3191a508dc796422caf7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-604",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Magram lived in southeastern Desolace, where their spokesman Warug received visitors on the village outskirts.",["title"]="Magram Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1368:description:1-59","1368:description:62-156","1368:description:161-243","1368:description:246-393","1368:objective:1-75"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1368,["sourceHash"]="39918a0c4de0c9f855471daf78b4973bfcbbdbd4b5107b6bf6d30c8573ba54c5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16021",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Uthek the Wise could be found outside the Gelkis settlement in southwestern Desolace.",["title"]="Gelkis Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1369:description:1-60","1369:description:63-78","1369:description:81-108","1369:description:111-144","1369:description:147-167","1369:description:172-203","1369:description:206-237","1369:description:240-296","1369:description:299-347","1369:objective:1-98"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1369,["sourceHash"]="f48d8ebcac1a6829b97ed04b01d4bd7971d2723e1dd8fd26e5e8e892203c3037"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16021",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Gelkis kept crystals called the tears of Theradras in a village cave; Magram hostility extended to destroying these treasures.",["title"]="Gelkis Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1380:description:1-37","1380:description:40-71","1380:description:74-114","1380:description:119-159","1380:description:162-209","1380:description:214-270","1380:description:273-330","1380:description:335-377","1380:description:380-410","1380:description:415-447","1380:description:449-454","1380:description:457-473","1380:objective:1-119"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1380,["sourceHash"]="822fdb9ee982701ab75d9ef55da0a751b0775f1fc807a002fb3116a68164d37e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-607",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A Maraudine war horn stood atop a high bluff in the valley, a rallying point used to bring the clan’s defenders and Khan Hratha into the open.",["title"]="Valley of Spears"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1481:description:1-63","1481:description:68-158","1481:description:160-232","1481:description:237-297","1481:description:299-362","1481:description:364-413","1481:description:418-486","1481:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1481,["sourceHash"]="a68a775dfab3c5458aec22e065dfc2ec927021d513c7a3a404d05834853e7631"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-4674",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hatefury shadowstalkers inhabited the ancient ruins in northeastern Desolace.",["title"]="Hatefury Shadowstalker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1481:description:1-63","1481:description:68-158","1481:description:160-232","1481:description:237-297","1481:description:299-362","1481:description:364-413","1481:description:418-486","1481:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1481,["sourceHash"]="a68a775dfab3c5458aec22e065dfc2ec927021d513c7a3a404d05834853e7631"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4674",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their scalps were sought for a rite intended to break a demon lord’s defenses against scrying.",["title"]="Hatefury Shadowstalker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1488:description:1-186","1488:description:191-330","1488:description:335-424","1488:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1488,["sourceHash"]="e77b00ebfc5fe05f343eebcc4297fae5061236569a045168159439a5e4972150"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-5760",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Horde investigators feared Azrethoc was trying to gain influence over the Burning Blade and called for a party to confront him and his warlock servant.",["title"]="Lord Azrethoc"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1532:description:1-117","1532:description:119-192","1532:description:197-340","1532:description:345-410","1532:description:412-476","1532:description:478-501","1532:objective:1-41"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1532,["sourceHash"]="5a6275dd201c8b909ec951b269a1040747fab2a1a4855b38e702f7d3ced488e2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-5905",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer taught shamans seeking a deeper command of air, receiving candidates in the eastern reaches of Thousand Needles.",["title"]="Prate Cloudseer"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1639:description:1-22","1639:description:25-74","1639:description:79-126","1639:description:129-137","1639:description:140-165","1639:description:170-242","1639:objective:1-20"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1639,["sourceHash"]="7d021b783efddb092dd434407ddbab4c84fa6471f62d86b38a6f54d95537d007"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6090",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bartleby’s drinking mug became a warrior’s test: the trainee was challenged to take it from the reluctant drinker at the end of the bar.",["title"]="Bartleby"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1667:description:1-27","1667:description:30-102","1667:description:107-162","1667:description:165-250","1667:description:253-326","1667:description:328-384","1667:description:389-406","1667:description:409-472","1667:objective:1-84"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1667,["sourceHash"]="600d7b7a87d7ee494c22d8960498ff3059a053b0e32a1212ea76f2998306caa8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-6093",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dead-Tooth Jack tricked a former Stormwind marshal into surrendering his badge by wearing a Stormwind tabard in the dark and passing for Marshal Dughan.",["title"]="Dead-Tooth Jack"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1667:description:1-27","1667:description:30-102","1667:description:107-162","1667:description:165-250","1667:description:253-326","1667:description:328-384","1667:description:389-406","1667:description:409-472","1667:objective:1-84"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1667,["sourceHash"]="600d7b7a87d7ee494c22d8960498ff3059a053b0e32a1212ea76f2998306caa8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-6093",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The deceived veteran wanted the badge recovered from Jack’s camp and identified him as a Defias villain.",["title"]="Dead-Tooth Jack"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1686:description:1-26","1686:description:29-59","1686:description:62-80","1686:description:85-125","1686:description:130-259","1686:description:264-329","1686:description:332-431","1686:description:434-503","1686:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1686,["sourceHash"]="22f91b662e8c65f6079158b6809b7848231d99101d568cdd68ff75807b01c624"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-6133",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Elura had captained the ship wrecked near Auberdine’s lighthouse, whose elunite cargo scattered across the sea floor.",["title"]="Shade of Elura"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1686:description:1-26","1686:description:29-59","1686:description:62-80","1686:description:85-125","1686:description:130-259","1686:description:264-329","1686:description:332-431","1686:description:434-503","1686:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1686,["sourceHash"]="22f91b662e8c65f6079158b6809b7848231d99101d568cdd68ff75807b01c624"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6133",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="She cursed herself to guard the shipment forever, leaving her shade and medallion between weapon-seekers and the lost ore.",["title"]="Shade of Elura"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1688:description:1-37","1688:description:39-140","1688:description:142-194","1688:description:196-238","1688:description:243-310","1688:description:312-401","1688:description:406-438","1688:description:440-488","1688:description:490-511","1688:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1688,["sourceHash"]="57d2bfb86b832a274290927ccf0189a21445e912c9460fc230317153dfd2e0c3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-880",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Erlan Drudgemoor was the Defias man with whom Surena Caledon left her warlock teacher, taking the bloodstone choker he had given her.",["title"]="Erlan Drudgemoor"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1705:description:1-61","1705:description:64-134","1705:description:137-203","1705:description:208-278","1705:description:283-328","1705:description:331-448","1705:description:453-484","1705:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1705,["sourceHash"]="d8ffa3ddc34c641a1a567c99046d156dd1c684575157db7c8ab2b4fc64ce27ef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6170",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Gutspill led the Nightbane worgen based in Roland’s Doom mine in Duskwood.",["title"]="Gutspill"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1705:description:1-61","1705:description:64-134","1705:description:137-203","1705:description:208-278","1705:description:283-328","1705:description:331-448","1705:description:453-484","1705:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1705,["sourceHash"]="d8ffa3ddc34c641a1a567c99046d156dd1c684575157db7c8ab2b4fc64ce27ef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6170",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A burning rock held by Gutspill was sought with the worgen’s burning blood to test Furen’s armor-making techniques.",["title"]="Gutspill"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1719:description:1-66","1719:description:69-212","1719:description:217-290","1719:description:293-374","1719:description:379-431","1719:description:434-486","1719:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1719,["sourceHash"]="e7d9cea738063d05003ad56273a4d75382f9a28eaa8b53e52e7b5b34b5680732"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6238",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Big Will was the final challenger in Fray Island’s test for aspiring warriors, called out only after the earlier opponents were beaten.",["title"]="Big Will"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1719:description:1-66","1719:description:69-212","1719:description:217-290","1719:description:293-374","1719:description:379-431","1719:description:434-486","1719:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1719,["sourceHash"]="e7d9cea738063d05003ad56273a4d75382f9a28eaa8b53e52e7b5b34b5680732"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6248",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Twiggy Flathead arranged the Fray Island challengers after a warrior signaled readiness by stepping onto the grate.",["title"]="Twiggy Flathead"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1719:description:1-66","1719:description:69-212","1719:description:217-290","1719:description:293-374","1719:description:379-431","1719:description:434-486","1719:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1719,["sourceHash"]="e7d9cea738063d05003ad56273a4d75382f9a28eaa8b53e52e7b5b34b5680732"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6248",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The test culminated in Big Will, with the warrior expected to return within the allotted time.",["title"]="Twiggy Flathead"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1758:description:1-97","1758:description:102-167","1758:description:169-253","1758:description:255-330","1758:description:335-379","1758:description:381-499","1758:objective:1-38"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1758,["sourceHash"]="2c43dc7637c7fe53853ae84cd22f32fbc5f8fa1bffdf5b8de14d9d36d31b0155"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6294",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Krom Stoutarm was a wandering warlock who collected ancient texts and frequented Ironforge’s library, a possible guide to the missing Tome of the Cabal.",["title"]="Krom Stoutarm"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1801:description:1-97","1801:description:102-167","1801:description:169-253","1801:description:255-330","1801:description:335-379","1801:description:381-495","1801:objective:1-42"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1801,["sourceHash"]="4dcaf44e3bdb6c9feaf584786c94b278f0510b84fe5fe629f29909942ba59ef6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6293",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jorah Annison worked as an Undercity cartographer while retaining a reputation for exceptional knowledge of ancient texts.",["title"]="Jorah Annison"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1819:description:1-73","1819:description:76-131","1819:description:134-207","1819:description:212-287","1819:description:290-326","1819:description:333-355","1819:description:360-424","1819:description:427-473","1819:description:478-484","1819:description:486-498","1819:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1819,["sourceHash"]="38790bdfe6cc2824b8a68169ec731a409543ff8abd887d50410c6e4e53a9df52"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-6390",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ulag the Cleaver was captured for study when the Scourge swept through Tirisfal. His captors found a free mind still subject to the Lich King’s hold.",["title"]="Ulag the Cleaver"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1819:description:1-73","1819:description:76-131","1819:description:134-207","1819:description:212-287","1819:description:290-326","1819:description:333-355","1819:description:360-424","1819:description:427-473","1819:description:478-484","1819:description:486-498","1819:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1819,["sourceHash"]="38790bdfe6cc2824b8a68169ec731a409543ff8abd887d50410c6e4e53a9df52"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6390",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their attempt to sever that control failed. A skull-stone trigger near the mausoleum could lift his magical confinement for the final confrontation.",["title"]="Ulag the Cleaver"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1844:description:1-68","1844:description:73-164","1844:description:167-287","1844:description:292-326","1844:description:331-392","1844:description:395-427","1844:description:430-502","1844:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1844,["sourceHash"]="257dfbecaba47a54c18fc3e8c285cac05a5ef097a94097160a9eb01b2de9d3ef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-6167",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A chimaera matriarch remained in the Charred Vale, where creatures were described as maddened by the suffering of the ruined land.",["title"]="Chimaera Matriarch"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1844:description:1-68","1844:description:73-164","1844:description:167-287","1844:description:292-326","1844:description:331-392","1844:description:395-427","1844:description:430-502","1844:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1844,["sourceHash"]="257dfbecaba47a54c18fc3e8c285cac05a5ef097a94097160a9eb01b2de9d3ef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6167",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A galvanized horn from the matriarch was requested as proof for a warrior’s helm, with her death presented as release from misery.",["title"]="Chimaera Matriarch"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"7840:description:1-98","7840:description:100-148","7840:description:150-161","7840:description:163-222","7840:description:224-235","7840:description:237-244","7840:description:246-293","7840:objective:1-76","7840:objective:78-118","7840:objective:123-180","7840:objective:182-213"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=7840,["sourceHash"]="a42ddfe2bdb63980bbf26abd3a009bb94d35b024bb471d4d0cd83202f9c3cf91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-14731",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lard fled a picnic after a Vilebranch struck him with a stick, leaving his lunch behind on his favorite island north of Revantusk.",["title"]="Lard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"7840:description:1-98","7840:description:100-148","7840:description:150-161","7840:description:163-222","7840:description:224-235","7840:description:237-244","7840:description:246-293","7840:objective:1-76","7840:objective:78-118","7840:objective:123-180","7840:objective:182-213"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=7840,["sourceHash"]="a42ddfe2bdb63980bbf26abd3a009bb94d35b024bb471d4d0cd83202f9c3cf91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-14731",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hunger drew him to ask for the meal’s recovery, but fear kept him from returning himself.",["title"]="Lard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"8368:description:1-84","8368:description:87-229","8368:description:234-260","8368:description:263-329","8368:objective:1-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=8368,["sourceHash"]="483e369547d71f443726fc90a68629c631e7577b92f3b8455a0ad58b14ccce21"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-15350",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Horde Warbringer framed Warsong’s battle as the defense of a major lumber supply, rejecting the Silverwing claim to be protecting their forest.",["title"]="Horde Warbringer"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"8416:description:1-45","8416:description:50-135","8416:description:138-199","8416:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=8416,["sourceHash"]="b53f736a24471abaf13be13bba1c902fd4871cd856674f160bfe412b43d9fea3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1854",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="High Priest Thel’danis purged evil from Scourgestones for Commander Ashlam’s plan, explaining that only a single inert stone was needed for the next step.",["title"]="High Priest Thel'danis"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1886:description:1-104","1886:description:109-167","1886:description:172-213","1886:description:215-323","1886:description:325-382","1886:description:387-460","1886:description:462-495","1886:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1886,["sourceHash"]="efdc225b5c9229a83ecb971c81c1304b8a1bfebb145ab331393b1da940443ca1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6497",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Astor Hadren carried messages between Silverpine Forest and the Undercity.",["title"]="Astor Hadren"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1886:description:1-104","1886:description:109-167","1886:description:172-213","1886:description:215-323","1886:description:325-382","1886:description:387-460","1886:description:462-495","1886:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1886,["sourceHash"]="efdc225b5c9229a83ecb971c81c1304b8a1bfebb145ab331393b1da940443ca1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-6497",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A Deathstalker recruitment test called for his personal effects while withholding the reason for the assignment.",["title"]="Astor Hadren"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1921:description:1-85","1921:description:88-165","1921:description:170-394","1921:description:399-504","1921:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1921,["sourceHash"]="f30cd474ffa48014b930d316d2aea9e629add389e67e61b1865cbe01ea265b5f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-1309",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Wynne Larson tailored robes for newly recognized mages at Larson Clothiers in Stormwind’s Mage Quarter, using linen and charged rift gems.",["title"]="Wynne Larson"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1940:description:1-37","1940:description:40-140","1940:description:143-213","1940:description:218-274","1940:description:277-344","1940:description:347-443","1940:description:446-470","1940:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1940,["sourceHash"]="05e8d3a97160e709641805ee392ab913e672eca041a438bc33219896e68ec042"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1309",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="For a more accomplished mage’s robe, Wynne required pristine silk from Duskwood’s carrion recluses.",["title"]="Wynne Larson"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1940:description:1-37","1940:description:40-140","1940:description:143-213","1940:description:218-274","1940:description:277-344","1940:description:347-443","1940:description:446-470","1940:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1940,["sourceHash"]="05e8d3a97160e709641805ee392ab913e672eca041a438bc33219896e68ec042"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-949",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The finest silk from Duskwood’s carrion recluse spiders was prized for a robe befitting an adept mage.",["title"]="Carrion Recluse"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1945:description:1-118","1945:description:123-258","1945:description:263-358","1945:description:361-414","1945:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1945,["sourceHash"]="4ba6022cd1464824cad25e4fa5f54458c6a70ec6e29d16633a98de834bd62bcb"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3484",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kil’hala was a troll tailor at the Crossroads, entrusted with making a mage’s robes from hair gathered from the laughing sisters near Raynewood Retreat.",["title"]="Kil'hala"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1960:description:1-84","1960:description:87-190","1960:description:195-250","1960:description:253-304","1960:description:307-435","1960:description:438-505","1960:objective:1-102","1960:objective:105-238"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1960,["sourceHash"]="ee154b6c3113fd5f84214c5af11041e5411b02ea4a52353212a5b3ad11b7b77b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-4610",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Algernon’s shop in the Undercity Apothecarium became the center of a disturbance involving invisible creatures composed of magic.",["title"]="Algernon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1960:description:1-84","1960:description:87-190","1960:description:195-250","1960:description:253-304","1960:description:307-435","1960:description:438-505","1960:objective:1-102","1960:objective:105-238"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1960,["sourceHash"]="ee154b6c3113fd5f84214c5af11041e5411b02ea4a52353212a5b3ad11b7b77b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4610",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Investigators were given a revealing scroll and coffers to subdue and contain the creatures without assuming what had caused their appearance.",["title"]="Algernon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1961:description:1-54","1961:description:57-119","1961:description:124-209","1961:description:212-371","1961:description:376-466","1961:objective:1-64"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1961,["sourceHash"]="44ee105f83ab12ebe879d1be42310bf52c168f55407d7c599e575c7c8b8ecf34"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4576",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Josef Gregorian worked in the Magic Quarter’s tailor shop, preparing first mage robes from linen and mana gems.",["title"]="Josef Gregorian"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1998:description:1-108","1998:description:110-241","1998:description:246-284","1998:description:286-371","1998:description:376-502","1998:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1998,["sourceHash"]="6e29d96cee61329e8f02fc85b2173082e63fba141b1348c18b862920591a33eb"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-6570",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Varimathras suspected Fenwick Thatros of leading undead established in Silverpine, prompting a Deathstalker mission against him.",["title"]="Fenwick Thatros"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1998:description:1-108","1998:description:110-241","1998:description:246-284","1998:description:286-371","1998:description:376-502","1998:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1998,["sourceHash"]="6e29d96cee61329e8f02fc85b2173082e63fba141b1348c18b862920591a33eb"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-6570",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The latest Deathstalker reports placed Thatros near a decrepit dock on Lordamere.",["title"]="Fenwick Thatros"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1999:description:1-122","1999:description:124-180","1999:description:182-271","1999:description:276-302","1999:description:304-375","1999:description:377-468","1999:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1999,["sourceHash"]="8b1e47272213fb82ec8fe67db035740363f4ac96e9e5d50e52968d6207faa444"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6566",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Estelle Gendry outfitted the Deathstalkers, supplying lockpicking tools for an attempt to obtain Kirin Tor documents from Ambermill.",["title"]="Estelle Gendry"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2118:description:1-89","2118:description:94-152","2118:description:154-233","2118:description:235-269","2118:description:274-327","2118:description:329-411","2118:description:413-457","2118:description:459-480","2118:objective:1-68","2118:objective:73-197"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2118,["sourceHash"]="2a5b1103abe6c706fc6de5e4fc33d7b5e7c03febb0a51d38e8627e6310412e0e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-2164",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The sickness spreading through Darkshore struck thistle bears especially hard, leaving the afflicted animals rabid and destructive.",["title"]="Rabid Thistle Bear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2118:description:1-89","2118:description:94-152","2118:description:154-233","2118:description:235-269","2118:description:274-327","2118:description:329-411","2118:description:413-457","2118:description:459-480","2118:objective:1-68","2118:objective:73-197"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2118,["sourceHash"]="2a5b1103abe6c706fc6de5e4fc33d7b5e7c03febb0a51d38e8627e6310412e0e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2164",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tharnariun proposed a possible cure and used a light-bearing trap to pacify an afflicted bear long enough to lead it back for examination.",["title"]="Rabid Thistle Bear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2159:description:1-20","2159:description:23-43","2159:description:46-115","2159:description:118-194","2159:description:199-234","2159:description:237-295","2159:description:298-334","2159:objective:1-50"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2159,["sourceHash"]="6df9db7a763c51eeeeae88d1876ff8c6edc52e88a0ea1d9f3faae4261b3a3663"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6736",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Innkeeper Keldamyr kept the Dolanaar inn and received herbal deliveries from helpers passing south out of Shadowglen.",["title"]="Innkeeper Keldamyr"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2160:description:1-4","2160:description:6-39","2160:description:41-144","2160:description:149-196","2160:description:198-278","2160:description:283-351","2160:description:353-448","2160:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2160,["sourceHash"]="d53ed52c5c7589f98e81d885bd0274e5ee546bda58d7df2e463d5e6839d56fd5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-6806",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tannok Frosthammer assisted Kharanos’s innkeeper and was entrusted with supplies carried through the mountain pass.",["title"]="Tannok Frosthammer"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2161:description:1-10","2161:description:13-28","2161:description:33-59","2161:description:62-127","2161:description:130-228","2161:description:231-259","2161:description:262-351","2161:description:356-378","2161:description:381-415","2161:description:418-434","2161:description:439-487","2161:description:490-499","2161:objective:1-53"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2161,["sourceHash"]="0675b9c67a9882ec17d8aac5265afbcfffea70d453a4f3ff367bc4b807fee176"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-6928",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Innkeeper Grosk kept the Razor Hill inn, where food mistakenly carried to the Valley of Trials was to be returned.",["title"]="Innkeeper Grosk"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2203:description:1-37","2203:description:40-113","2203:description:115-168","2203:description:171-186","2203:description:191-341","2203:description:344-402","2203:description:405-453","2203:description:458-495","2203:objective:1-85","2203:objective:88-155"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2203,["sourceHash"]="02c0805f56dc872f99b03f557b133664db0984e81d3fce8227f562ee219d07b8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2726",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Scorched guardians were dragons whose blood could be drawn into attuned thaumaturgy vessels, a process that provoked the living creature’s anger.",["title"]="Scorched Guardian"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2242:description:1-116","2242:description:118-188","2242:description:193-250","2242:description:252-348","2242:description:350-383","2242:description:388-459","2242:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2242,["sourceHash"]="9abfe35328f1507c265feffb03164177c6adc47db853f442e29c3db2b67f3ff3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-6909",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sethir the Ancient was a reclusive satyr whose knowledge was sought as a possible explanation of Teldrassil’s forest troubles.",["title"]="Sethir the Ancient"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2242:description:1-116","2242:description:118-188","2242:description:193-250","2242:description:252-348","2242:description:350-383","2242:description:388-459","2242:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2242,["sourceHash"]="9abfe35328f1507c265feffb03164177c6adc47db853f442e29c3db2b67f3ff3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-6909",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He hid on a branch at the edge of the Oracle Glade.",["title"]="Sethir the Ancient"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2242:description:1-116","2242:description:118-188","2242:description:193-250","2242:description:252-348","2242:description:350-383","2242:description:388-459","2242:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2242,["sourceHash"]="9abfe35328f1507c265feffb03164177c6adc47db853f442e29c3db2b67f3ff3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-6909",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Both forceful and diplomatic approaches had ended disastrously, leading the investigators to consider quietly searching his packs instead.",["title"]="Sethir the Ancient"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1056:description:1-63","1056:description:68-153","1056:description:155-251","1056:description:253-375","1056:description:380-408","1056:description:410-430","1056:description:435-463","1056:objective:1-45"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1056,["sourceHash"]="cc407b6f78f514198a917636f7feb866c5f3064580f276afb3dca7989ee0f798"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1276",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The tunnel south of Mystral Lake linked Ashenvale to Windshear Crag in the Stonetalon Mountains.",["title"]="The Talondeep Path"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1089:description:1-87","1089:description:92-168","1089:description:173-196","1089:description:198-235","1089:description:240-384","1089:description:386-485","1089:objective:1-37","1089:objective:39-98","1089:objective:100-143"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1089,["sourceHash"]="782a9709f8954ba30eb220c7849138c96a2484a53cd69defc0f42766f08bd007"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-location-area-468",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak and guarded powerful possessions within it.",["title"]="The Talon Den"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1089:description:1-87","1089:description:92-168","1089:description:173-196","1089:description:198-235","1089:description:240-384","1089:description:386-485","1089:objective:1-37","1089:objective:39-98","1089:objective:100-143"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1089,["sourceHash"]="782a9709f8954ba30eb220c7849138c96a2484a53cd69defc0f42766f08bd007"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-468",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A sequence of locked caches protected the central hoard; a key concealed in a small entrance lantern began the scheme described by an enemy of the druids.",["title"]="The Talon Den"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1079:description:1-15","1079:description:17-36","1079:description:38-80","1079:description:85-192","1079:description:197-283","1079:description:285-421","1079:objective:1-84"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1079,["sourceHash"]="28b68cc7c7f7e6e1f4dc0343b2fd615f14cca0552ee3fed62f5278733f9f4d22"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-463",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Venture Company kept engineering plans inside a lumber mill south of the lake, making the workings a target for a covert theft under cover of explosives.",["title"]="Cragpool Lake"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1123:description:1-155","1123:description:158-216","1123:description:221-276","1123:description:279-379","1123:description:382-491","1123:description:494-503","1123:objective:1-66","1123:objective:69-165"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1123,["sourceHash"]="b2eecf13ec8af171ca777d376596c3ac42600f9ec55bf90731a09fac0a89759d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="reviewed-nighthaven",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nighthaven was Moonglade’s principal village, where Keeper Remulos’s majordomo Rabine Saturna coordinated requests for aid.",["title"]="Nighthaven"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1123:description:1-155","1123:description:158-216","1123:description:221-276","1123:description:279-379","1123:description:382-491","1123:description:494-503","1123:objective:1-66","1123:objective:69-165"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1123,["sourceHash"]="b2eecf13ec8af171ca777d376596c3ac42600f9ec55bf90731a09fac0a89759d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="reviewed-nighthaven",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The journey there carried a warning to look beyond racial boundaries amid tensions between Darnassus’s night elves and the Cenarion Circle.",["title"]="Nighthaven"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1124:description:1-84","1124:description:87-181","1124:description:184-255","1124:description:257-275","1124:description:280-418","1124:description:421-485","1124:objective:1-100"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1124,["sourceHash"]="090ed09ffffd1d6a1518c23bfbdb3543a904d5e4ffbacefd9b62a4974255805e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-3077",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Valor’s Rest was the final resting place of those who fell in Silithus’s wastes.",["title"]="Valor's Rest"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1124:description:1-84","1124:description:87-181","1124:description:184-255","1124:description:257-275","1124:description:280-418","1124:description:421-485","1124:objective:1-100"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1124,["sourceHash"]="090ed09ffffd1d6a1518c23bfbdb3543a904d5e4ffbacefd9b62a4974255805e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-3077",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Cenarion agent Layo Starstrike watched for signs that forces in the desert were stirring the evil sealed after an ancient war.",["title"]="Valor's Rest"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1125:description:1-69","1125:description:72-111","1125:description:116-206","1125:description:209-277","1125:description:280-346","1125:description:351-429","1125:description:432-505","1125:objective:1-162"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1125,["sourceHash"]="73112336ef3cf93b9869ee32bc4d75903db48624e597e77b5f7c4f445ebe21ed"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2738",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Southwind had once served as a night elf base in Silithus before the silithid overran it.",["title"]="Southwind Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1125:description:1-69","1125:description:72-111","1125:description:116-206","1125:description:209-277","1125:description:280-346","1125:description:351-429","1125:description:432-505","1125:objective:1-162"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1125,["sourceHash"]="73112336ef3cf93b9869ee32bc4d75903db48624e597e77b5f7c4f445ebe21ed"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2738",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Fallen druids and sentinels wandered the ruined village as tormented spirits.",["title"]="Southwind Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1126:description:1-93","1126:description:96-256","1126:description:261-345","1126:description:348-397","1126:description:400-442","1126:description:445-500","1126:objective:1-96","1126:objective:99-217"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1126,["sourceHash"]="1e975ea4bc5c6c99c693795c84e4db113f507672ed955dadad3008b7f147304d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2738",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Wasps circled the village tower, where the hive was strongest. The silithid reacted to the spirits’ death cries, suggesting a dangerous connection between the hauntings and the insects.",["title"]="Southwind Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1150:description:1-87","1150:description:89-152","1150:description:157-185","1150:description:187-235","1150:description:237-307","1150:description:309-497","1150:objective:1-61"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1150,["sourceHash"]="2fd451b3722c95e1dfca3699f598763a1d2d4f6dd303d19cb4584903cc2c9de6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-487",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The harpy den lay west of Freewind Post, with food stores deep inside its passages.",["title"]="Roguefeather Den"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1150:description:1-87","1150:description:89-152","1150:description:157-185","1150:description:187-235","1150:description:237-307","1150:description:309-497","1150:objective:1-61"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1150,["sourceHash"]="2fd451b3722c95e1dfca3699f598763a1d2d4f6dd303d19cb4584903cc2c9de6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-487",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Destroying those provisions was the provocation proposed to draw Grenka Bloodscreech into a trial of endurance.",["title"]="Roguefeather Den"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1140:description:1-73","1140:description:75-210","1140:description:215-388","1140:description:393-509","1140:objective:1-115"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1140,["sourceHash"]="7216b52ce07916d9325ef384b3c5d645f40417f6b5f1503a3fb706ee47a75272"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-428",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Night Run was a satyr-held refuge in northeastern Ashenvale, named in Ilkrud’s writings as one of the places safeguarding Athrikus’s soulgems.",["title"]="Night Run"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1140:description:1-73","1140:description:75-210","1140:description:215-388","1140:description:393-509","1140:objective:1-115"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1140,["sourceHash"]="7216b52ce07916d9325ef384b3c5d645f40417f6b5f1503a3fb706ee47a75272"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16007",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Satyrnaar’s blood-stained temples sheltered satyrs in northeastern Ashenvale; Ilkrud’s writings connected the site to Athrikus’s remaining soulgems.",["title"]="Satyrnaar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1172:description:1-56","1172:description:58-116","1172:description:121-175","1172:description:177-212","1172:description:214-264","1172:description:269-358","1172:description:363-382","1172:description:384-414","1172:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1172,["sourceHash"]="ede75b30db890fb6b85529a7ce467b18e0a0a1192b75ea087eea27b7e1d68076"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-510",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Onyxia’s scattered brood made the Dragonmurk a breeding ground that threatened the ogres’ hopes of reclaiming Stonemaul Village.",["title"]="The Dragonmurk"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2439:description:1-34","2439:description:37-183","2439:description:186-250","2439:description:255-330","2439:description:333-399","2439:description:404-496","2439:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2439,["sourceHash"]="e39f33bbf2ae2d64fadad5e4879d26b6dcbddbb589c5280026fc95375c39346b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7292",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dinita Stonemantle at Ironforge’s vault was the contact for redeeming a voucher awarded for bringing the platinum discs to scholarly attention.",["title"]="Dinita Stonemantle"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2440:description:1-97","2440:description:102-190","2440:description:193-268","2440:description:271-410","2440:description:415-504","2440:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2440,["sourceHash"]="b5755f5e1e8db3a565de487ac22b43d12ccf37caf3f44ab644b15f4413e97794"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3009",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bena Winterhoof taught alchemy in Thunder Bluff and supplied the promised potions and special item when a finder brought the platinum-disc reward voucher.",["title"]="Bena Winterhoof"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2478:description:1-62","2478:description:64-143","2478:description:148-206","2478:description:208-276","2478:description:278-308","2478:description:313-436","2478:description:438-509","2478:objective:1-81","2478:objective:83-105","2478:objective:107-137","2478:objective:139-147","2478:objective:152-294","2478:objective:296-384"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2478,["sourceHash"]="94536c93e5ec7c09ae1758abfd22c5f982cb0d614be54df13758a5961dafe458"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7287",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Foreman Silixiz held the tower key needed during the mission against Gallywix, whose lockbox contained a cache of Zanzil’s mixture.",["title"]="Foreman Silixiz"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2499:description:1-157","2499:description:162-298","2499:description:301-333","2499:description:338-418","2499:description:420-509","2499:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2499,["sourceHash"]="7e2b4bc0fb6b421f14c6ae8b2aa2084389f264af4323c28605863fb632888458"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2166",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Oakenscowl was a timberling blamed for spreading corruption among the creatures around Lake Al’Ameth.",["title"]="Oakenscowl"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2499:description:1-157","2499:description:162-298","2499:description:301-333","2499:description:338-418","2499:description:420-509","2499:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2499,["sourceHash"]="7e2b4bc0fb6b421f14c6ae8b2aa2084389f264af4323c28605863fb632888458"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-2166",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Denalan could see an exceptionally large tumor poisoning Oakenscowl even without approaching him.",["title"]="Oakenscowl"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2499:description:1-157","2499:description:162-298","2499:description:301-333","2499:description:338-418","2499:description:420-509","2499:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2499,["sourceHash"]="7e2b4bc0fb6b421f14c6ae8b2aa2084389f264af4323c28605863fb632888458"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-2166",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Oakenscowl occupied a cave along the lake’s southern bank.",["title"]="Oakenscowl"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2541:description:1-130","2541:description:132-258","2541:description:260-321","2541:description:326-342","2541:description:344-451","2541:description:453-480","2541:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2541,["sourceHash"]="3e100dbe798abf50c21113ca8b1a75cec8abe67e0bfd9a517fe426a5ed3fb8ae"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-2009",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Gnarlpine shamans had separated a sleeping druid’s spirit from his body, leaving the spirit trapped in the Emerald Dream while the animated body attacked visitors to Ban’ethil.",["title"]="Gnarlpine Shaman"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2541:description:1-130","2541:description:132-258","2541:description:260-321","2541:description:326-342","2541:description:344-451","2541:description:453-480","2541:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2541,["sourceHash"]="3e100dbe798abf50c21113ca8b1a75cec8abe67e0bfd9a517fe426a5ed3fb8ae"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2009",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A charm carried by the shamans was used in the rite and offered the trapped druid a way to study what had been done.",["title"]="Gnarlpine Shaman"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2583:description:1-89","2583:description:94-270","2583:description:275-314","2583:description:316-467","2583:description:469-502","2583:objective:1-97"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2583,["sourceHash"]="131546d52d1c5f22e18af4c937955c6e2f2e5cef4c09ea3fcc352372f0c36888"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5993",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Helboars were among the Blasted Lands’ two boar varieties. Their endurance made them difficult prey for other local animals, prompting an alchemist to investigate their lungs.",["title"]="Helboar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2601:description:1-56","2601:description:58-158","2601:description:163-313","2601:description:318-343","2601:description:348-387","2601:description:389-492","2601:objective:1-72"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2601,["sourceHash"]="4f8c0b19f501f3ec74c923cd09f9a9332d8cd083193c006d647b5e653e8683c1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-5990",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="An observer considered redstone basilisks unusually successful in adapting to the Blasted Lands and credited them with complex behavior worth studying.",["title"]="Redstone Basilisk"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2601:description:1-56","2601:description:58-158","2601:description:163-313","2601:description:318-343","2601:description:348-387","2601:description:389-492","2601:objective:1-72"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2601,["sourceHash"]="4f8c0b19f501f3ec74c923cd09f9a9332d8cd083193c006d647b5e653e8683c1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-5990",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Redstone basilisks flourished throughout the wasteland rather than lingering only as rare survivors.",["title"]="Redstone Basilisk"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2609:description:1-19","2609:description:21-42","2609:description:47-84","2609:description:89-252","2609:description:254-351","2609:description:356-423","2609:description:425-435","2609:description:437-493","2609:objective:1-135","2609:objective:137-189"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2609,["sourceHash"]="9f7743d01935aca239d1fc556bed210123b4c82c0f74539c716677976270710c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3520",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ol’ Emma left light chartreuse silk thread at the Finest Thread, a spool later needed among the ingredients of a treatment for Zanzil’s affliction.",["title"]="Ol' Emma"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2768:description:1-27","2768:description:30-102","2768:description:105-167","2768:description:172-200","2768:description:203-302","2768:description:305-332","2768:description:337-456","2768:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2768,["sourceHash"]="77d6c818f7850e1c539a6c11cec2903ed0d588a490db699bded7cd26a4c23474"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-7604",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bilgewhizzle accused Sergeant Bly of taking a divining rod on a supposed loan and keeping it, depriving him of a tool for locating new water holes.",["title"]="Sergeant Bly"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2768:description:1-27","2768:description:30-102","2768:description:105-167","2768:description:172-200","2768:description:203-302","2768:description:305-332","2768:description:337-456","2768:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2768,["sourceHash"]="77d6c818f7850e1c539a6c11cec2903ed0d588a490db699bded7cd26a4c23474"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7604",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bly was reported to have led a treasure-hunting band into Zul’Farrak, where recovering the borrowed rod might require confronting his company.",["title"]="Sergeant Bly"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2770:description:1-75","2770:description:78-123","2770:description:126-136","2770:description:139-194","2770:description:197-242","2770:description:247-291","2770:description:296-363","2770:description:366-420","2770:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2770,["sourceHash"]="5fa845a44a0b625ae93b1411a604c0d14c281126ac00e0332c7dd87bbccfef94"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="atlas-figure-gahzrilla",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Gahz’rilla’s scales crackled with energy that Wizzle Brassbolts hoped to harness for a racing car; learning the trolls’ summoning secret was part of reaching the beast.",["title"]="Gahz’rilla"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2781:description:1-28","2781:description:33-176","2781:description:179-197","2781:description:206-234","2781:description:236-245","2781:description:248-277","2781:description:279-288","2781:description:291-319","2781:description:321-329","2781:description:334-432","2781:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2781,["sourceHash"]="6ef6ba832e7fb5e0674993745f2b172f56e9c0fa4c906d9eb82f5adb644e794e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-7847",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Caliph Scorpidsting led the Wastewander outlaws pursued by the Gadgetzan Water Company.",["title"]="Caliph Scorpidsting"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2781:description:1-28","2781:description:33-176","2781:description:179-197","2781:description:206-234","2781:description:236-245","2781:description:248-277","2781:description:279-288","2781:description:291-319","2781:description:321-329","2781:description:334-432","2781:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2781,["sourceHash"]="6ef6ba832e7fb5e0674993745f2b172f56e9c0fa4c906d9eb82f5adb644e794e"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-7847",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The company’s bounty accused him of killing its workers and taking its supplies and property, directing claimants to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.",["title"]="Caliph Scorpidsting"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2845:description:1-72","2845:description:74-109","2845:description:111-162","2845:description:164-225","2845:description:230-298","2845:description:303-368","2845:description:370-397","2845:description:399-490","2845:objective:1-35","2845:objective:40-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2845,["sourceHash"]="f8cffa09a27bccc125d26b297d4802a62c5a33cdd0ee8aeb7e93e2f7bd34ceb4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7774",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Shay Leafrunner was easily distracted by the sights around her and needed help returning to Rockbiter.",["title"]="Shay Leafrunner"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2845:description:1-72","2845:description:74-109","2845:description:111-162","2845:description:164-225","2845:description:230-298","2845:description:303-368","2845:description:370-397","2845:description:399-490","2845:objective:1-35","2845:objective:40-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2845,["sourceHash"]="f8cffa09a27bccc125d26b297d4802a62c5a33cdd0ee8aeb7e93e2f7bd34ceb4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-7774",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A cherished bell could draw her back when she wandered away from an escort.",["title"]="Shay Leafrunner"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2845:description:1-72","2845:description:74-109","2845:description:111-162","2845:description:164-225","2845:description:230-298","2845:description:303-368","2845:description:370-397","2845:description:399-490","2845:objective:1-35","2845:objective:40-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2845,["sourceHash"]="f8cffa09a27bccc125d26b297d4802a62c5a33cdd0ee8aeb7e93e2f7bd34ceb4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-7765",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rockbiter was the friend meant to be watching Shay Leafrunner before her curiosity carried her away.",["title"]="Rockbiter"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2846:description:1-73","2846:description:76-162","2846:description:167-245","2846:description:248-309","2846:description:312-323","2846:description:328-348","2846:description:351-439","2846:description:442-482","2846:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2846,["sourceHash"]="4cc77b61f6eda165d5e472a0a01d6e31193a436a0690b7ba3d715f135c0a2df5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-7795",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tabetha accused Hydromancer Velratha of sending agents to steal the powerful Tiara of the Deep from her home.",["title"]="Hydromancer Velratha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2846:description:1-73","2846:description:76-162","2846:description:167-245","2846:description:248-309","2846:description:312-323","2846:description:328-348","2846:description:351-439","2846:description:442-482","2846:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2846,["sourceHash"]="4cc77b61f6eda165d5e472a0a01d6e31193a436a0690b7ba3d715f135c0a2df5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-7795",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tabetha directed the search for Velratha and the stolen tiara to the troll city of Zul’Farrak.",["title"]="Hydromancer Velratha"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2853:description:1-45","2853:description:48-124","2853:description:127-181","2853:description:184-226","2853:description:228-262","2853:description:265-346","2853:description:351-418","2853:description:421-490","2853:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2853,["sourceHash"]="e771b621d0a802c4cb2e53a728023740e018f5fee01974d9d7e4ef64f10f895a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4212",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Telonis taught leatherworking in Darnassus and was the master to whom a promising Wild Leather pupil was sent for final recognition.",["title"]="Telonis"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2871:description:1-89","2871:description:92-211","2871:description:214-294","2871:description:297-369","2871:description:371-390","2871:description:395-440","2871:description:443-453","2871:objective:1-75"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2871,["sourceHash"]="6fa45fc886dcf9077a711bc12dd8b3fb25b93cc29df3de8fa49d268837fca26c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-7878",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Vestia Moonspear served her community as both a priestess and a widely respected scholar.",["title"]="Vestia Moonspear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2871:description:1-89","2871:description:92-211","2871:description:214-294","2871:description:297-369","2871:description:371-390","2871:description:395-440","2871:description:443-453","2871:objective:1-75"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2871,["sourceHash"]="6fa45fc886dcf9077a711bc12dd8b3fb25b93cc29df3de8fa49d268837fca26c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-7878",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Her husband Latronicus trusted her learning to explain a recovered relic whose purpose he could not decipher himself.",["title"]="Vestia Moonspear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2922:description:1-96","2922:description:99-234","2922:description:237-258","2922:description:260-296","2922:description:299-330","2922:description:335-365","2922:description:368-507","2922:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2922,["sourceHash"]="c8a89eb94af4db8739b07b2ed842092a7287cc2e83873399d2a8d54e5bd40a05"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-6231",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Techbot was Overspark’s information-rich mechanical assistant before Gnomeregan fell.",["title"]="Techbot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2922:description:1-96","2922:description:99-234","2922:description:237-258","2922:description:260-296","2922:description:299-330","2922:description:335-365","2922:description:368-507","2922:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2922,["sourceHash"]="c8a89eb94af4db8739b07b2ed842092a7287cc2e83873399d2a8d54e5bd40a05"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-6231",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Overspark believed a stray spark had reversed its positronic brain into a negatronic state, turning helpful behavior into frenzy.",["title"]="Techbot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2922:description:1-96","2922:description:99-234","2922:description:237-258","2922:description:260-296","2922:description:299-330","2922:description:335-365","2922:description:368-507","2922:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2922,["sourceHash"]="c8a89eb94af4db8739b07b2ed842092a7287cc2e83873399d2a8d54e5bd40a05"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6231",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Recovering the memory core might reveal the fault and permit repair; the proposed rescue of the machine was not an accomplished restoration.",["title"]="Techbot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2941:description:1-128","2941:description:130-204","2941:description:206-258","2941:description:260-313","2941:description:318-366","2941:description:368-430","2941:description:432-469","2941:objective:1-48"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2941,["sourceHash"]="3442d36f1299bd901d4ee95bf2fb8d9c9324895fbf8e85ba4afc5b35b9a5ac58"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-7977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Gammerita was a giant snapjaw singled out by Daryn Lightwind for study.",["title"]="Gammerita"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2941:description:1-128","2941:description:130-204","2941:description:206-258","2941:description:260-313","2941:description:318-366","2941:description:368-430","2941:description:432-469","2941:objective:1-48"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2941,["sourceHash"]="3442d36f1299bd901d4ee95bf2fb8d9c9324895fbf8e85ba4afc5b35b9a5ac58"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-7977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="She lived among the snapjaws along the Hinterlands’ beach.",["title"]="Gammerita"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2941:description:1-128","2941:description:130-204","2941:description:206-258","2941:description:260-313","2941:description:318-366","2941:description:368-430","2941:description:432-469","2941:objective:1-48"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2941,["sourceHash"]="3442d36f1299bd901d4ee95bf2fb8d9c9324895fbf8e85ba4afc5b35b9a5ac58"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Unable to leave his other research, Daryn sought a picture made with Curgle Cranklehop’s new image-capturing invention.",["title"]="Gammerita"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2975:description:1-76","2975:description:78-130","2975:description:132-199","2975:description:204-259","2975:description:261-287","2975:description:289-341","2975:objective:1-108"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2975,["sourceHash"]="2bced290408064fdd5bafd9c4d01a3f6e6c3fab7f62840424b39494d04842bc2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-5229",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Horde observers blamed the Gordunni presence for scars on Feralas’s land and sought to push back their growing foothold.",["title"]="Gordunni Ogre"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2975:description:1-76","2975:description:78-130","2975:description:132-199","2975:description:204-259","2975:description:261-287","2975:description:289-341","2975:objective:1-108"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2975,["sourceHash"]="2bced290408064fdd5bafd9c4d01a3f6e6c3fab7f62840424b39494d04842bc2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-5229",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A Gordunni outpost stood along the river in Feralas, with directions to approach it from the south.",["title"]="Gordunni Ogre"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2993:description:1-90","2993:description:93-194","2993:description:199-204","2993:description:207-226","2993:description:229-264","2993:objective:1-35"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2993,["sourceHash"]="502a7e305d75ca93649883bf0ad863c9c2d2a4a524956f7d09f2dde7cd7678d2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-7995",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Vile Priestess Hexx was the Vilebranch high priestess who held the key to Sharpbeak’s cage.",["title"]="Vile Priestess Hexx"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2993:description:1-90","2993:description:93-194","2993:description:199-204","2993:description:207-226","2993:description:229-264","2993:objective:1-35"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2993,["sourceHash"]="502a7e305d75ca93649883bf0ad863c9c2d2a4a524956f7d09f2dde7cd7678d2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-7995",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The captive was held high above Jintha’Alor, drawing the rescue effort into the Vilebranch stronghold.",["title"]="Vile Priestess Hexx"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2988:description:1-41","2988:description:43-173","2988:description:178-193","2988:description:196-278","2988:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2988,["sourceHash"]="46e7583269dad21a27e70fb96b44a624d45724db799bdead7cf51fe04c6ff83a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-8023",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sharpbeak was the heir of the gryphon Swiftwing, lost while hunting with his parents.",["title"]="Sharpbeak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2993:description:1-90","2993:description:93-194","2993:description:199-204","2993:description:207-226","2993:description:229-264","2993:objective:1-35"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2993,["sourceHash"]="502a7e305d75ca93649883bf0ad863c9c2d2a4a524956f7d09f2dde7cd7678d2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-8023",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Thadius Grimshade identified Sharpbeak’s prison as a cage near the summit of Jintha’Alor, with its key held by Hexx.",["title"]="Sharpbeak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2988:description:1-41","2988:description:43-173","2988:description:178-193","2988:description:196-278","2988:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2988,["sourceHash"]="46e7583269dad21a27e70fb96b44a624d45724db799bdead7cf51fe04c6ff83a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-8023",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Before that answer, the search began with the Witherbark villages’ cages, where the gryphon master hoped to find evidence of the missing young gryphon.",["title"]="Sharpbeak"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1221:description:1-48","1221:description:51-78","1221:description:81-169","1221:description:174-250","1221:description:253-322","1221:description:325-390","1221:description:395-466","1221:objective:1-24","1221:objective:27-59","1221:objective:62-106","1221:objective:111-255","1221:objective:260-368"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1221,["sourceHash"]="5c7dcf9b394bb8b8eec78e530be577c3efdc1827d7382414f4851dd802655c50"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4781",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Snufflenose gophers were trained to locate the rare blueleaf tubers buried beneath Razorfen Kraul.",["title"]="Snufflenose Gopher"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1221:description:1-48","1221:description:51-78","1221:description:81-169","1221:description:174-250","1221:description:253-322","1221:description:325-390","1221:description:395-466","1221:objective:1-24","1221:objective:27-59","1221:objective:62-106","1221:objective:111-255","1221:objective:260-368"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1221,["sourceHash"]="5c7dcf9b394bb8b8eec78e530be577c3efdc1827d7382414f4851dd802655c50"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4781",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Their trainer credited them with smelling a tuber from fifty paces away, making the animals essential to finding the hidden delicacy.",["title"]="Snufflenose Gopher"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1196:description:1-96","1196:description:98-194","1196:description:199-253","1196:objective:1-72"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1196,["sourceHash"]="82a1c3dab3e654906127087b88182e3b3da292ed709faaf287347e2e7efae5e5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1718",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Great Lift connected the southern edge of the Barrens with the route down into Thousand Needles.",["title"]="The Great Lift"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1220:description:1-54","1220:description:57-102","1220:description:105-165","1220:description:170-244","1220:objective:1-47"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1220,["sourceHash"]="f4acb675ac3d7c41e3e022420533550f61f59e64b20f9fb978ecbc0f50aae95a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-513",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The northeastern barracks housed Captain Vimes, whose knowledge of Orcish made him the person to consult about a recovered Horde report.",["title"]="Theramore Isle"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1241:description:1-72","1241:description:74-101","1241:description:106-174","1241:description:176-273","1241:description:278-386","1241:description:391-452","1241:description:454-511","1241:objective:1-30"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1241,["sourceHash"]="10e4fb4c4a0ef00fb787d9d46c8156015fb8c7247dbc6eeae003e66cad94866b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1617",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jorgen, a trusted contact in the inquiry into a diplomat’s disappearance, could be found in the Valley of Heroes.",["title"]="Valley of Heroes"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1244:description:1-16","1244:description:18-111","1244:description:116-190","1244:description:192-288","1244:description:290-342","1244:description:347-414","1244:description:419-494","1244:objective:1-67"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1244,["sourceHash"]="2b3e763f1ce2fffec429ef90641488f5818b5a7f1f9a9069267596ebdd7f8c69"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16159",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The farmstead stood south of the road from Westfall at the entrance to Duskwood.",["title"]="Addle's Stead"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1244:description:1-16","1244:description:18-111","1244:description:116-190","1244:description:192-288","1244:description:290-342","1244:description:347-414","1244:description:419-494","1244:objective:1-67"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1244,["sourceHash"]="2b3e763f1ce2fffec429ef90641488f5818b5a7f1f9a9069267596ebdd7f8c69"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16159",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="An unusual gathering of Defias agents at the farm prompted investigators to look there for clues to the missing diplomat.",["title"]="Addle's Stead"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1251:description:1-188","1251:description:193-248","1251:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1251,["sourceHash"]="176d02134521dd2d41e7f3b94c8c3a8990b92c5aec5049145dd4c6d2aa23da70"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-location-area-403",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A crumbling chimney was among the few structures left standing after the fire, with a blackened iron shield fastened to its bricks.",["title"]="Shady Rest Inn"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1268:description:1-83","1268:description:85-205","1268:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1268,["sourceHash"]="2cf65d7f64b7f198f566cc309f7800f14805d085ce78234194a43750dd253304"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-403",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rows of hoofprints led away through the marsh mud while the inn’s remains still smoked, offering a physical clue without identifying who made them.",["title"]="Shady Rest Inn"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1365:description:1-48","1365:description:51-124","1365:description:127-206","1365:description:209-269","1365:description:274-314","1365:description:319-364","1365:description:367-412","1365:description:417-456","1365:description:459-490","1365:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1365,["sourceHash"]="972a58414043949ba63f186869c854cfbba6caa830ae35540f2e74d83c7e62e4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-609",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The village was the Desolace Kolkar’s foothold under Khan Dez’hepah, whose death was proposed as a way to disrupt the clan before the centaur could unite.",["title"]="Kolkar Village"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3062:description:1-93","3062:description:95-158","3062:description:160-235","3062:description:237-289","3062:description:294-431","3062:description:436-506","3062:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3062,["sourceHash"]="dcf950b5bd5c2ae42499421830a440f922d558a500c732b41fe11819d81cf050"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-8075",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Edana Hatetalon ruled the Northspring harpies inhabiting the western ruins of Feralas.",["title"]="Edana Hatetalon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3062:description:1-93","3062:description:95-158","3062:description:160-235","3062:description:237-289","3062:description:294-431","3062:description:436-506","3062:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3062,["sourceHash"]="dcf950b5bd5c2ae42499421830a440f922d558a500c732b41fe11819d81cf050"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-8075",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Talo Thornhoof repeated a story that Edana’s heart was crystal, describing a queen he believed consumed by hatred.",["title"]="Edana Hatetalon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3062:description:1-93","3062:description:95-158","3062:description:160-235","3062:description:237-289","3062:description:294-431","3062:description:436-506","3062:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3062,["sourceHash"]="dcf950b5bd5c2ae42499421830a440f922d558a500c732b41fe11819d81cf050"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-8075",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Hatetalon stones in the northern ruins were the place where a harpy horn could call their queen.",["title"]="Edana Hatetalon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3084:description:1-50","3084:description:55-81","3084:description:83-143","3084:description:145-192","3084:objective:1-41"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3084,["sourceHash"]="562658128d1aba5d6734e85f04b86db271074eb9e3a9c788e5a97cca03c2a8aa"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3157",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Shikrik taught shamanic training and sent a rune-inscribed tablet to summon a new pupil for instruction.",["title"]="Shikrik"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3096:description:1-86","3096:description:88-195","3096:description:197-255","3096:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3096,["sourceHash"]="4613bac4aa9543b7011a2860a304bd5d60322722d9a1c4066353ec6e31d29cef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-2122",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="David Trias was a rogue trainer who called a newly awakened Forsaken pupil through a sealed, encrypted scroll.",["title"]="David Trias"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3098:description:1-86","3098:description:88-191","3098:description:193-251","3098:objective:1-74"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3098,["sourceHash"]="22845d0290f284add76e0f391ecaca74ab77027e6d8aa85266a828bc2eff7307"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-2124",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Isabella taught mages among the Forsaken, sending a glyph-marked scroll to a pupil already confronting the mindless Scourge.",["title"]="Isabella"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3099:description:1-86","3099:description:88-197","3099:description:199-257","3099:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3099,["sourceHash"]="85544bc827c605bed570d25cc8744ce79658ea33c91990756086c2b1a653f673"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-2126",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Maximillion taught warlocks and summoned a Forsaken pupil with a tainted scroll bearing his seal.",["title"]="Maximillion"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3101:description:1-94","3101:description:96-192","3101:description:194-281","3101:objective:1-77"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3101,["sourceHash"]="3e2ff16ee146a749f03568cb8dc00405d7b9cac5d5746e9d319452870ed013db"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-925",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Brother Sammuel trained paladins at Northshire Abbey and sent a sealed letter to a pupil returning from the kobold camps.",["title"]="Brother Sammuel"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3103:description:1-94","3103:description:96-192","3103:description:194-281","3103:objective:1-75"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3103,["sourceHash"]="b3744cc25cef87509973d74c98d2f877c1f23d2c2bc18b93bd595d0606c4f513"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-375",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Priestess Anetta taught the local priests of Northshire Abbey, calling a new pupil through a hallowed letter.",["title"]="Priestess Anetta"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3116:description:1-77","3116:description:79-145","3116:description:147-185","3116:objective:1-58"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3116,["sourceHash"]="1fe75d2ae97a3bd4a44296e36ec1e7187887c8928ab903d6bb1a7333c2b89415"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-3593",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Alyissia taught warriors and sent a messenger with a simple sigil asking a new pupil to meet her.",["title"]="Alyissia"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3301:description:1-92","3301:description:95-186","3301:description:189-271","3301:description:276-352","3301:description:355-386","3301:description:389-479","3301:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3301,["sourceHash"]="06d20269423a21fc6e4666958fb9e1a2e5655bd3014f2cebca35fb6eeb14f708"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-8385",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mura Runetotem traveled to Silverpine to help the Forsaken by trying to restore life to the dying forest.",["title"]="Mura Runetotem"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3301:description:1-92","3301:description:95-186","3301:description:189-271","3301:description:276-352","3301:description:355-386","3301:description:389-479","3301:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3301,["sourceHash"]="06d20269423a21fc6e4666958fb9e1a2e5655bd3014f2cebca35fb6eeb14f708"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-8385",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="She stayed at the Sepulcher while pursuing that work.",["title"]="Mura Runetotem"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3301:description:1-92","3301:description:95-186","3301:description:189-271","3301:description:276-352","3301:description:355-386","3301:description:389-479","3301:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3301,["sourceHash"]="06d20269423a21fc6e4666958fb9e1a2e5655bd3014f2cebca35fb6eeb14f708"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-8385",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Her clanmate Tonga hoped that a sample of the Barrens’ unusual shells might give Mura another way to understand Silverpine’s sickness.",["title"]="Mura Runetotem"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3368:description:1-8","3368:description:13-57","3368:description:59-134","3368:description:139-216","3368:description:218-314","3368:description:316-347","3368:description:349-433","3368:description:438-456","3368:description:458-492","3368:description:497-503","3368:objective:1-47","3368:objective:49-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3368,["sourceHash"]="e524cbd4fa77b760dc4d712291ea93d13aed73ea62047b788664ece73881988a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-8391",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dorius’s final letter accused Lathoric the Black of using Suntara stones to enslave the excavation team and twist their minds.",["title"]="Lathoric the Black"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3368:description:1-8","3368:description:13-57","3368:description:59-134","3368:description:139-216","3368:description:218-314","3368:description:316-347","3368:description:349-433","3368:description:438-456","3368:description:458-492","3368:description:497-503","3368:objective:1-47","3368:objective:49-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3368,["sourceHash"]="e524cbd4fa77b760dc4d712291ea93d13aed73ea62047b788664ece73881988a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-8391",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The captive archaeologists were being driven to work night and day on a project called Obsidion in the Cauldron.",["title"]="Lathoric the Black"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3368:description:1-8","3368:description:13-57","3368:description:59-134","3368:description:139-216","3368:description:218-314","3368:description:316-347","3368:description:349-433","3368:description:438-456","3368:description:458-492","3368:description:497-503","3368:objective:1-47","3368:objective:49-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3368,["sourceHash"]="e524cbd4fa77b760dc4d712291ea93d13aed73ea62047b788664ece73881988a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-8400",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dorius’s letter named Obsidion as the work imposed on his enslaved excavation team by Lathoric and the Dark Irons.",["title"]="Obsidion"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3385:description:1-131","3385:description:136-153","3385:description:155-218","3385:description:220-326","3385:description:331-389","3385:description:391-435","3385:description:437-489","3385:description:494-509","3385:objective:1-45","3385:objective:47-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3385,["sourceHash"]="06de3c71d67392e59b5d6590d9ff204a0209eafa16ba6ca87952ba5f66709a25"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-8444",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Trade Master Kovic directed the Undermarket’s Searing Gorge operation.",["title"]="Trade Master Kovic"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3385:description:1-131","3385:description:136-153","3385:description:155-218","3385:description:220-326","3385:description:331-389","3385:description:391-435","3385:description:437-489","3385:description:494-509","3385:objective:1-45","3385:objective:47-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3385,["sourceHash"]="06de3c71d67392e59b5d6590d9ff204a0209eafa16ba6ca87952ba5f66709a25"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-8444",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He maintained close ties with the region’s Dark Iron dwarves and was served by a minion named Clunk.",["title"]="Trade Master Kovic"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3385:description:1-131","3385:description:136-153","3385:description:155-218","3385:description:220-326","3385:description:331-389","3385:description:391-435","3385:description:437-489","3385:description:494-509","3385:objective:1-45","3385:objective:47-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3385,["sourceHash"]="06de3c71d67392e59b5d6590d9ff204a0209eafa16ba6ca87952ba5f66709a25"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-8444",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nilith Lokrav described the Undermarket as traders willing to sell or transport almost anything for payment and sought to strike at Kovic’s leadership.",["title"]="Trade Master Kovic"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3385:description:1-131","3385:description:136-153","3385:description:155-218","3385:description:220-326","3385:description:331-389","3385:description:391-435","3385:description:437-489","3385:description:494-509","3385:objective:1-45","3385:objective:47-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3385,["sourceHash"]="06de3c71d67392e59b5d6590d9ff204a0209eafa16ba6ca87952ba5f66709a25"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-8447",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Clunk served Trade Master Kovic in the Undermarket’s Cauldron operation, becoming a target alongside the trader.",["title"]="Clunk"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3402:description:1-86","3402:description:88-184","3402:objective:1-34"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3402,["sourceHash"]="927fc031a29f692ecda9ea52d1c59d5bc2b490076b6129ff1d53cbf028660fe5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6568",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nilith expected Vizzklick in Gadgetzan to welcome news of Kovic’s defeat and asked that the report reach him personally.",["title"]="Vizzklick"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3512:description:1-85","3512:description:88-183","3512:description:186-275","3512:description:280-393","3512:description:396-440","3512:description:443-506","3512:objective:1-85"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3512,["sourceHash"]="39b0383b757788165a203b28920713d6f9b80e26cd22afde81e12fc84f610516"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-8588",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Umbranse was a human medium who spoke for the dead, a mortal ally approached in hopes of reaching Eranikus through his tainted essence.",["title"]="Umbranse the Spiritspeaker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3512:description:1-85","3512:description:88-183","3512:description:186-275","3512:description:280-393","3512:description:396-440","3512:description:443-506","3512:objective:1-85"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3512,["sourceHash"]="39b0383b757788165a203b28920713d6f9b80e26cd22afde81e12fc84f610516"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-8588",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Itharius directed the search for Umbranse into the icy eastern reaches of Winterspring.",["title"]="Umbranse the Spiritspeaker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3512:description:1-85","3512:description:88-183","3512:description:186-275","3512:description:280-393","3512:description:396-440","3512:description:443-506","3512:objective:1-85"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3512,["sourceHash"]="39b0383b757788165a203b28920713d6f9b80e26cd22afde81e12fc84f610516"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-8588",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The proposed consultation was uncertain: Eranikus lay between sleep and death, not truly dead, and might remain beyond even a spiritspeaker’s aid.",["title"]="Umbranse the Spiritspeaker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3519:description:1-8","3519:description:10-120","3519:description:122-180","3519:description:185-216","3519:description:218-245","3519:description:250-257","3519:description:259-273","3519:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3519,["sourceHash"]="e5c489424f37178c7e5a66d9b768d4de683df3e704275e0f3503531ee8bd5a91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-1994",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Iverron named Githyiss the Vile as the spider that had badly bitten him during his exploration of a nearby cave.",["title"]="Githyiss the Vile"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3519:description:1-8","3519:description:10-120","3519:description:122-180","3519:description:185-216","3519:description:218-245","3519:description:250-257","3519:description:259-273","3519:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3519,["sourceHash"]="e5c489424f37178c7e5a66d9b768d4de683df3e704275e0f3503531ee8bd5a91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1994",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dizziness and fear of serious poisoning led the wounded explorer to seek Dirania Silvershine’s help.",["title"]="Githyiss the Vile"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3519:description:1-8","3519:description:10-120","3519:description:122-180","3519:description:185-216","3519:description:218-245","3519:description:250-257","3519:description:259-273","3519:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3519,["sourceHash"]="e5c489424f37178c7e5a66d9b768d4de683df3e704275e0f3503531ee8bd5a91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-8583",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The injured Iverron trusted Dirania Silvershine to help him after Githyiss’s bite and asked that his distress be brought to her quickly.",["title"]="Dirania Silvershine"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1456:description:1-11","1456:description:16-60","1456:description:65-176","1456:description:178-233","1456:description:235-265","1456:description:270-349","1456:description:351-464","1456:objective:1-67"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1456,["sourceHash"]="97a120ab67db6b542f96ecb11603150edb019807375c2c50cf1c6e60b39ce47b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2406",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Submerged night elf ruins near Ranazjar Isle housed the Slitherblade naga, whose stronger tidehunters and sea witches were considered likely keepers of Karnitol’s missing belongings.",["title"]="Ranazjar Isle"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1476:description:1-26","1476:description:28-49","1476:description:54-156","1476:description:161-308","1476:description:313-431","1476:description:436-468","1476:description:470-508","1476:objective:1-103"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1476,["sourceHash"]="dce5cf92695fffde9f6b4fc4f3b7b247542c0bc95dcebf53e7a83e62922ad963"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-230",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lordaeron refugees were being refused passage at the wall. Dalin Forgewright devoted himself to caring for the people left outside.",["title"]="The Greymane Wall"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1517:description:1-63","1517:description:65-161","1517:description:163-279","1517:description:284-365","1517:description:370-451","1517:description:453-482","1517:description:484-503","1517:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1517,["sourceHash"]="b20a14b03f5f513cf9aebbc237cf553c9d1a13d271b67edbb4b746fad2de5551"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-638",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Hidden Path ended at Spirit Rock, the sacred place Canaga Earthcaller directed a shaman to visit with earth sapta.",["title"]="Hidden Path"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1517:description:1-63","1517:description:65-161","1517:description:163-279","1517:description:284-365","1517:description:370-451","1517:description:453-482","1517:description:484-503","1517:objective:1-43"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1517,["sourceHash"]="b20a14b03f5f513cf9aebbc237cf553c9d1a13d271b67edbb4b746fad2de5551"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-638",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The pilgrimage’s destination mattered as much as the drink: sapta was to be taken only in a holy place, binding a strong-willed spirit to its element.",["title"]="Hidden Path"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1524:description:1-89","1524:description:94-213","1524:description:215-343","1524:description:348-410","1524:description:412-510","1524:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1524,["sourceHash"]="5401786b258286cc3e038d99f5b90490430d1a77d25bbd34ae4eadf9818c8257"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-640",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A hidden trail along the Southfury River in Durotar climbed toward the high peak where the shrine stood.",["title"]="Shrine of the Dormant Flame"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1524:description:1-89","1524:description:94-213","1524:description:215-343","1524:description:348-410","1524:description:412-510","1524:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1524,["sourceHash"]="5401786b258286cc3e038d99f5b90490430d1a77d25bbd34ae4eadf9818c8257"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-location-area-640",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Telf Joolam watched the holy shrine, where a shaman’s torch was to be kindled for the fire-totem trial.",["title"]="Shrine of the Dormant Flame"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1524:description:1-89","1524:description:94-213","1524:description:215-343","1524:description:348-410","1524:description:412-510","1524:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1524,["sourceHash"]="5401786b258286cc3e038d99f5b90490430d1a77d25bbd34ae4eadf9818c8257"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-640",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bringing the torch marked an attempt to master fire, while returning it aflame from the shrine’s brazier would establish readiness for the totem.",["title"]="Shrine of the Dormant Flame"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1681:description:1-90","1681:description:93-142","1681:description:147-213","1681:description:216-311","1681:description:313-362","1681:description:365-385","1681:description:390-449","1681:description:452-502","1681:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1681,["sourceHash"]="fccb85b23cf7d6c18c9ba0bc55f87f80ed388490ee6adfc3c3ab227f2bc4897a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-716",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sturgy Ironband’s compound lay south of Helm’s Bed Lake in eastern Dun Morogh.",["title"]="Ironband's Compound"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1681:description:1-90","1681:description:93-142","1681:description:147-213","1681:description:216-311","1681:description:313-362","1681:description:365-385","1681:description:390-449","1681:description:452-502","1681:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1681,["sourceHash"]="fccb85b23cf7d6c18c9ba0bc55f87f80ed388490ee6adfc3c3ab227f2bc4897a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-location-area-716",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ironband taught blacksmithing there before a pupil brought him unusual material he called umbral ore.",["title"]="Ironband's Compound"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1681:description:1-90","1681:description:93-142","1681:description:147-213","1681:description:216-311","1681:description:313-362","1681:description:365-385","1681:description:390-449","1681:description:452-502","1681:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1681,["sourceHash"]="fccb85b23cf7d6c18c9ba0bc55f87f80ed388490ee6adfc3c3ab227f2bc4897a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-716",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dark Iron dwarves attacked soon after the ore arrived and killed the people at the compound, leaving a pupil to seek vengeance and recover the material.",["title"]="Ironband's Compound"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1681:description:1-90","1681:description:93-142","1681:description:147-213","1681:description:216-311","1681:description:313-362","1681:description:365-385","1681:description:390-449","1681:description:452-502","1681:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1681,["sourceHash"]="fccb85b23cf7d6c18c9ba0bc55f87f80ed388490ee6adfc3c3ab227f2bc4897a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-212",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sturgy Ironband’s blacksmithing school stood south of the lake, tying this part of eastern Dun Morogh to the disastrous discovery of umbral ore.",["title"]="Helm's Bed Lake"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3783:description:1-49","3783:description:51-92","3783:description:94-105","3783:description:107-151","3783:description:153-212","3783:description:218-253","3783:description:255-376","3783:description:381-442","3783:description:444-457","3783:description:459-492","3783:objective:1-61"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3783,["sourceHash"]="a49088baa0aae9d559ce907d4c0dca06e2817a592670c6d0f4236d630148200c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-7458",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ice thistle yetis had the thick fur Umi Rumplesnicker sought to cover her mechanical imitation.",["title"]="Ice Thistle Yeti"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3783:description:1-49","3783:description:51-92","3783:description:94-105","3783:description:107-151","3783:description:153-212","3783:description:218-253","3783:description:255-376","3783:description:381-442","3783:description:444-457","3783:description:459-492","3783:objective:1-61"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3783,["sourceHash"]="a49088baa0aae9d559ce907d4c0dca06e2817a592670c6d0f4236d630148200c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7458",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Umi’s plans turned a hunt for yeti fur into the beginning of a contraption intended to startle and impress her friends.",["title"]="Ice Thistle Yeti"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3822:description:1-34","3822:description:36-62","3822:description:67-133","3822:description:138-193","3822:description:195-261","3822:description:263-347","3822:description:349-379","3822:description:384-411","3822:description:413-443","3822:description:448-490","3822:description:492-507","3822:objective:1-80","3822:objective:82-134"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3822,["sourceHash"]="f8155b317bd55a178253e4a6c61a4a40a8cfcb83402b940285bd612e7f90416b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-8977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Sha’ni Proudtusk’s spirit accused Krom’Grul of slaughtering her captured platoon, then reserving her for a brutal ritual.",["title"]="Krom'Grul"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3822:description:1-34","3822:description:36-62","3822:description:67-133","3822:description:138-193","3822:description:195-261","3822:description:263-347","3822:description:349-379","3822:description:384-411","3822:description:413-443","3822:description:448-490","3822:description:492-507","3822:objective:1-80","3822:objective:82-134"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3822,["sourceHash"]="f8155b317bd55a178253e4a6c61a4a40a8cfcb83402b940285bd612e7f90416b"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-8977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="According to Sha’ni, he took her wedding nose-ring after her death and wore it on his finger; recovering it would carry her last message back to Thal’trak.",["title"]="Krom'Grul"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3905:description:1-69","3905:description:72-190","3905:description:195-254","3905:description:256-288","3905:objective:1-62"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3905,["sourceHash"]="f720618bf1c57274704398c598ad6c69413886b4ea9b23d2729dbfd8bfa6481c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-952",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Brother Neals managed Northshire Abbey’s stores of food and drink.",["title"]="Brother Neals"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3905:description:1-69","3905:description:72-190","3905:description:195-254","3905:description:256-288","3905:objective:1-62"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3905,["sourceHash"]="f720618bf1c57274704398c598ad6c69413886b4ea9b23d2729dbfd8bfa6481c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-952",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="He favored the bell tower for tasting his wine, the place Milly directed the bearer of her grape manifest to find him.",["title"]="Brother Neals"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3906:description:1-56","3906:description:58-181","3906:description:183-228","3906:description:233-306","3906:description:308-375","3906:description:380-415","3906:objective:1-69","3906:objective:71-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3906,["sourceHash"]="5060c0869b2827f8988f77a630ae5d92e1a1c406e8efb22b576b2859a9b73825"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-9026",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Thunderheart identified Overmaster Pyron as the fire spirit summoned by the Dark Irons and feared its presence would bring lasting drought.",["title"]="Overmaster Pyron"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3906:description:1-56","3906:description:58-181","3906:description:183-228","3906:description:233-306","3906:description:308-375","3906:description:380-415","3906:objective:1-69","3906:objective:71-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3906,["sourceHash"]="5060c0869b2827f8988f77a630ae5d92e1a1c406e8efb22b576b2859a9b73825"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-9026",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The search led through Blackrock Mountain’s Chasm of Flame toward the quarry.",["title"]="Overmaster Pyron"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3907:description:1-59","3907:description:61-144","3907:description:149-198","3907:description:200-213","3907:description:215-226","3907:description:228-247","3907:description:249-273","3907:description:278-322","3907:description:324-377","3907:objective:1-53","3907:objective:55-129"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3907,["sourceHash"]="ca83a6f544bad2ea380f882f96e319bf1179be469cffeaf743bc94c2857810b0"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9017",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Thunderheart sensed a deeper source of the elemental disturbance in Lord Incendius, yet believed the being was only an emissary serving a hidden master.",["title"]="Lord Incendius"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4005:description:1-46","4005:description:48-107","4005:description:112-150","4005:description:155-308","4005:description:313-434","4005:objective:1-77","4005:objective:82-124","4005:objective:129-179","4005:objective:181-207"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4005,["sourceHash"]="f95d8e1e53c00addaffe2c84df15a03f30d6877e7e368fff8e81435b5913a72c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-9453",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Aquementas could transform the gathered supplies into a totem intended to oppose Blazerunner.",["title"]="Aquementas"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4005:description:1-46","4005:description:48-107","4005:description:112-150","4005:description:155-308","4005:description:313-434","4005:objective:1-77","4005:objective:82-124","4005:objective:129-179","4005:objective:181-207"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4005,["sourceHash"]="f95d8e1e53c00addaffe2c84df15a03f30d6877e7e368fff8e81435b5913a72c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-9453",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The prescribed summoning circle stood among stones on Lost Rigger Cove’s easternmost peninsula in Tanaris.",["title"]="Aquementas"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4005:description:1-46","4005:description:48-107","4005:description:112-150","4005:description:155-308","4005:description:313-434","4005:objective:1-77","4005:objective:82-124","4005:objective:129-179","4005:objective:181-207"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4005,["sourceHash"]="f95d8e1e53c00addaffe2c84df15a03f30d6877e7e368fff8e81435b5913a72c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9453",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Reading the Book of Aquor there would call Aquementas; the supplicant had to remain within the circle for the transformation despite the creature’s displeasure at being awakened.",["title"]="Aquementas"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4021:description:1-93","4021:description:96-213","4021:description:216-299","4021:description:304-365","4021:description:368-423","4021:description:426-480","4021:description:485-510","4021:objective:1-80"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4021,["sourceHash"]="973ac62cf579cbbd6a0d34421639fd3857204eeafd86d3fdec7ca9023c4d286d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-9456",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Warlord Krom’zar led a Kolkar contingent sent from Desolace against the Horde’s Barrens bunkers.",["title"]="Warlord Krom'zar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4021:description:1-93","4021:description:96-213","4021:description:216-299","4021:description:304-365","4021:description:368-423","4021:description:426-480","4021:description:485-510","4021:objective:1-80"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4021,["sourceHash"]="973ac62cf579cbbd6a0d34421639fd3857204eeafd86d3fdec7ca9023c4d286d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-9456",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Regthar’s scouts reported the force approaching from the west in retaliation for earlier defeats, with a piece of Krom’zar’s banner requested as proof of its leader’s fall.",["title"]="Warlord Krom'zar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4024:description:1-59","4024:description:61-121","4024:description:123-174","4024:description:179-276","4024:description:278-362","4024:description:367-428","4024:description:433-456","4024:objective:1-45","4024:objective:50-110","4024:objective:112-214","4024:objective:219-273"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4024,["sourceHash"]="7fc1d9cc9699ac7bfdcd73238055e3b9f63730e6d74aac12a01995919216c097"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-9016",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Cyrus described Bael’Gar as a being of pure flame born from Ragnaros’s fires.",["title"]="Bael'Gar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4024:description:1-59","4024:description:61-121","4024:description:123-174","4024:description:179-276","4024:description:278-362","4024:description:367-428","4024:description:433-456","4024:objective:1-45","4024:objective:50-110","4024:objective:112-214","4024:objective:219-273"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4024,["sourceHash"]="7fc1d9cc9699ac7bfdcd73238055e3b9f63730e6d74aac12a01995919216c097"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9016",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Cyrus coveted the creature’s inner heat and provided a molt to draw a portion safely from its smoldering remains.",["title"]="Bael'Gar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4081:description:1-76","4081:description:81-167","4081:description:172-299","4081:description:301-376","4081:description:381-494","4081:objective:1-60","4081:objective:65-169","4081:objective:171-211"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4081,["sourceHash"]="cbaa4ffbab226c28e3f7c3e0bfe48761e9c1133139ba44582f7c9cac1f94d95d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-9033",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Goretooth’s public order accused General Angerforge’s troops of destroying the Kargath Expeditionary Force’s 109th division.",["title"]="General Angerforge"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4081:description:1-76","4081:description:81-167","4081:description:172-299","4081:description:301-376","4081:description:381-494","4081:objective:1-60","4081:objective:65-169","4081:objective:171-211"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4081,["sourceHash"]="cbaa4ffbab226c28e3f7c3e0bfe48761e9c1133139ba44582f7c9cac1f94d95d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9033",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The reprisal called for the general’s first defensive line in Blackrock Depths to be broken, warning that his soldiers were dangerous opponents.",["title"]="General Angerforge"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4123:description:1-38","4123:description:41-110","4123:description:113-213","4123:description:218-243","4123:description:248-344","4123:description:347-465","4123:description:470-479","4123:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4123,["sourceHash"]="909995536d05b66fd8aa03b59524fc30b207b233ce82973b1f59a11fc6388b01"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-9476",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Watchman Doomgrip defended the Black Vault’s hidden wealth, including the gem called the Heart of the Mountain.",["title"]="Watchman Doomgrip"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4123:description:1-38","4123:description:41-110","4123:description:113-213","4123:description:218-243","4123:description:248-344","4123:description:347-465","4123:description:470-479","4123:objective:1-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4123,["sourceHash"]="909995536d05b66fd8aa03b59524fc30b207b233ce82973b1f59a11fc6388b01"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9476",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Maxwort’s plan depended on opening every relic coffer to draw the watchman out before breaching the secret safe.",["title"]="Watchman Doomgrip"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4201:description:1-22","4201:description:25-71","4201:description:74-86","4201:description:89-103","4201:description:108-124","4201:description:127-231","4201:description:234-392","4201:description:395-431","4201:description:436-491","4201:objective:1-108"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4201,["sourceHash"]="978f1a61f809857cc5381876a725d7cea2c850324de3581ee7d93ac949d8f2a8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-9503",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Mistress Nagmara was infatuated with Private Rocknot and sought a potion to overcome what she saw as his indifference.",["title"]="Private Rocknot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4290:description:1-86","4290:description:88-156","4290:description:158-230","4290:description:232-317","4290:description:322-365","4290:description:370-462","4290:description:467-490","4290:objective:1-141"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4290,["sourceHash"]="fd748a3ca7d1de749bae7bf33b89427928b797be06c8a4149cdb15fd16e27096"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-9684",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Torwa recalled his brother stealing meat from Lar’korwi’s kill. The predator stalked him for days and finally killed him as he tried to leave the crater.",["title"]="Lar'korwi"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4291:description:1-55","4291:description:57-131","4291:description:136-247","4291:description:249-299","4291:description:301-364","4291:description:366-477","4291:description:479-507","4291:objective:1-90"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4291,["sourceHash"]="f3d7b8c36ccb666a7f9b27b53c8072b3f8b47ca6065b6713ba0dc7091aefb196"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-9684",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lar’korwi was the dominant male among the local ravasaurs, with numerous mates.",["title"]="Lar'korwi"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4292:description:1-82","4292:description:84-152","4292:description:154-186","4292:description:188-301","4292:description:303-349","4292:description:351-395","4292:description:397-493","4292:objective:1-69","4292:objective:71-154"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4292,["sourceHash"]="d185c2dcc39af2892842a0eb0c449b0c2824f5dc0451c221fabe71e85ddc7f57"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9684",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Torwa proposed mixing stolen kill-meat with the females’ scent to lure him to a mountain trail strewn with the bones of large creatures.",["title"]="Lar'korwi"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4291:description:1-55","4291:description:57-131","4291:description:136-247","4291:description:249-299","4291:description:301-364","4291:description:366-477","4291:description:479-507","4291:objective:1-90"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4291,["sourceHash"]="f3d7b8c36ccb666a7f9b27b53c8072b3f8b47ca6065b6713ba0dc7091aefb196"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-6505",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Female ravasaurs guarding their eggs produced a strong scent from glands in their heads; Torwa used that breeding signal in his plan to draw out Lar’korwi.",["title"]="Ravasaur"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4297:description:1-75","4297:description:77-128","4297:description:130-219","4297:description:221-315","4297:description:317-376","4297:description:381-505","4297:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4297,["sourceHash"]="74c07e84eafed2889536c354ae4129746cbba6898822e3e898f631ba72fc03e9"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2926",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Silvermane stalker meat was gathered to provision a sprite darter hatchling, whose mixed diet included raw meat as well as vegetation.",["title"]="Silvermane Stalker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4501:description:1-100","4501:description:102-184","4501:description:189-264","4501:description:269-333","4501:objective:1-96"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4501,["sourceHash"]="96efe227aeae63b681cd8f108fce479be7d616dc1ce9c5750f9e156a47bae1ba"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-9166",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A posted bounty warned that increasing pterrordax numbers threatened travelers in Un’Goro and offered payment through Spraggle Frock.",["title"]="Pterrordax"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4503:description:1-28","4503:description:33-106","4503:description:108-199","4503:description:204-224","4503:description:226-358","4503:description:360-441","4503:description:443-470","4503:objective:1-99"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4503,["sourceHash"]="1bd87a5105940bf168390ce5ecf154cc46cf59280d7a762c62ac785d4783aa91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-9166",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Shizzle sought the creatures’ webbed scales as material for the wings of his homemade flying machine.",["title"]="Pterrordax"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4501:description:1-100","4501:description:102-184","4501:description:189-264","4501:description:269-333","4501:objective:1-96"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4501,["sourceHash"]="96efe227aeae63b681cd8f108fce479be7d616dc1ce9c5750f9e156a47bae1ba"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-9167",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Frenzied pterrordax were included in the effort to reduce attacks on travelers crossing the crater.",["title"]="Frenzied Pterrordax"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4503:description:1-28","4503:description:33-106","4503:description:108-199","4503:description:204-224","4503:description:226-358","4503:description:360-441","4503:description:443-470","4503:objective:1-99"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4503,["sourceHash"]="1bd87a5105940bf168390ce5ecf154cc46cf59280d7a762c62ac785d4783aa91"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-9163",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Diemetradon scales were among the webbed materials Shizzle hoped to use for a flying machine, his alternative to riding the gryphons and wind riders that frightened him.",["title"]="Diemetradon"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4510:description:1-36","4510:description:39-133","4510:description:136-268","4510:description:270-324","4510:description:329-366","4510:description:369-457","4510:description:460-499","4510:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4510,["sourceHash"]="b672e69d0b93e748097169d8e781a3a039f9562267c80ffffd4008215d745d73"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-4155",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Idriana worked at the bank in Darnassus, where a note could authorize a gift from the patron’s vault after the Un’Goro research.",["title"]="Idriana"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4783:description:1-108","4783:description:113-158","4783:description:160-277","4783:description:282-344","4783:description:346-423","4783:description:428-477","4783:objective:1-97"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4783,["sourceHash"]="e731cd075f46cdb4c7743118fdbe0c986a0bf4f28ebc2954183f38b40bfb53fa"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4676",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The lesser infernals of Mannoroc Coven held the smoldering stones sought with Hatefury blood for Menara’s enchanted robe.",["title"]="Lesser Infernal"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4809:description:1-102","4809:description:105-234","4809:description:237-291","4809:description:296-373","4809:objective:1-56"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4809,["sourceHash"]="2cc9c8bd8cc9e9b0b3c38d337911fba5f1fd4887234c8a57ccbb48c7bc3d065d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-7448",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Chillwind chimaera horns concentrated intense cold; only pristine, uncracked specimens would serve the order being prepared for Tinkee.",["title"]="Chillwind Chimaera"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4811:description:1-60","4811:description:63-125","4811:description:128-239","4811:description:244-358","4811:description:361-430","4811:description:433-503","4811:objective:1-100","4811:objective:103-169"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4811,["sourceHash"]="3c94ed3de3f118e8de0eef1771970258eec466af8f1e42e8eaae99ff60c599c6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-10158",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Reports placed increasingly hostile moonkin around a mysterious red crystal near Darkshore’s eastern mountains, alarming Auberdine’s defenders.",["title"]="Moonkin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4811:description:1-60","4811:description:63-125","4811:description:128-239","4811:description:244-358","4811:description:361-430","4811:description:433-503","4811:objective:1-100","4811:objective:103-169"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4811,["sourceHash"]="3c94ed3de3f118e8de0eef1771970258eec466af8f1e42e8eaae99ff60c599c6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-10158",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Some still regarded the creatures as gentle or mystical, while the search for the crystal’s explanation began without knowing what had drawn them.",["title"]="Moonkin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1684:description:1-19","1684:description:22-97","1684:description:100-149","1684:description:154-220","1684:description:223-243","1684:objective:1-20"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1684,["sourceHash"]="82a206b02eaff124a2547bdaa4d2c5bc25dea4cf7ba694083a205b19e9d20b2d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1660",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Darnassus’s Warrior’s Terrace was where a growing warrior could seek Elanaria’s further instruction.",["title"]="Warrior's Terrace"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1705:description:1-61","1705:description:64-134","1705:description:137-203","1705:description:208-278","1705:description:283-328","1705:description:331-448","1705:description:453-484","1705:objective:1-82"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1705,["sourceHash"]="d8ffa3ddc34c641a1a567c99046d156dd1c684575157db7c8ab2b4fc64ce27ef"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-2161",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nightbane worgen occupied the mine under Gutspill, whose burning rock and followers’ unusual blood drew interest from armor-makers.",["title"]="Roland's Doom"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1738:description:1-101","1738:description:103-135","1738:description:140-202","1738:description:204-307","1738:description:312-353","1738:description:355-450","1738:objective:1-109"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1738,["sourceHash"]="51053311c74160a843988d96e45aa0a40e95459126c9a330a398c0033126eaf2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-412",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Takar’s vision placed the heartswood here: a tree said to have grown where two lovers fell together in the War of the Ancients.",["title"]="The Ruins of Ordil'Aran"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"1738:description:1-101","1738:description:103-135","1738:description:140-202","1738:description:204-307","1738:description:312-353","1738:description:355-450","1738:objective:1-109"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=1738,["sourceHash"]="51053311c74160a843988d96e45aa0a40e95459126c9a330a398c0033126eaf2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-412",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The tree’s association with enduring love made its core a proposed lure for a succubus.",["title"]="The Ruins of Ordil'Aran"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2206:description:1-83","2206:description:85-251","2206:description:256-333","2206:description:335-405","2206:description:410-496","2206:objective:1-85"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2206,["sourceHash"]="d72e82541d1fc844f2805caa948e92884313453e78643d5c9c3c6640e317e554"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16150",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="SI:7 reports described a Defias takeover of the landing, turning it into a smuggling point between Redridge and Westfall.",["title"]="Jerod's Landing"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2206:description:1-83","2206:description:85-251","2206:description:256-333","2206:description:335-405","2206:description:410-496","2206:objective:1-85"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2206,["sourceHash"]="d72e82541d1fc844f2805caa948e92884313453e78643d5c9c3c6640e317e554"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16150",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The dockmaster’s shipping schedule became the target of an infiltration into the dock house, a means of understanding the contraband route.",["title"]="Jerod's Landing"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2282:description:1-43","2282:description:45-126","2282:description:131-177","2282:description:179-233","2282:description:235-251","2282:description:253-322","2282:objective:1-90"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2282,["sourceHash"]="34e1e74ffd38eb8f312531725b51cfad875fc12bd6e828cac23f122ce5c5f899"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-97",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lucius used a locked chest at the mill as a test for aspiring thieves, asking for the token inside before granting recognition.",["title"]="Alther's Mill"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2767:description:1-53","2767:description:58-151","2767:description:154-234","2767:description:237-329","2767:description:332-402","2767:description:407-475","2767:description:478-505","2767:objective:1-105"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2767,["sourceHash"]="85a8971787bcc0991a8928cf7dcbfa26d2ca6399c04cb7a5f691c27d6e00160d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1108",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The coastal dock offered Oglethorpe an open place to prepare OOX-22/FE for takeoff and restore its cloaking system, provided the damaged machine could be escorted there.",["title"]="The Forgotten Coast"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2742:description:1-7","2742:description:12-44","2742:description:46-72","2742:description:74-140","2742:description:142-162","2742:description:167-257","2742:description:262-318","2742:objective:1-106"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2742,["sourceHash"]="3146a33aaddf7abdfb1033c85cc71568b3d6dea55c2612714356da12047a6594"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-16038",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The captive Rin’ji promised a secret hidden at the Overlook Cliffs as an inducement to help him escape.",["title"]="The Overlook Cliffs"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4862:description:1-101","4862:description:106-224","4862:description:226-251","4862:description:256-278","4862:description:280-343","4862:description:345-447","4862:objective:1-70","4862:objective:75-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4862,["sourceHash"]="54e9a04378ca6afa7fda3b724f83d53ed7de7cb14224bf0bd5bb803a0aa1b605"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-10374",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kibler sought spire spider eggs for a trade in unusual domesticated beasts and offered to raise one for a helper who gathered them.",["title"]="Spire Spider"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4862:description:1-101","4862:description:106-224","4862:description:226-251","4862:description:256-278","4862:description:280-343","4862:description:345-447","4862:objective:1-70","4862:objective:75-133"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4862,["sourceHash"]="54e9a04378ca6afa7fda3b724f83d53ed7de7cb14224bf0bd5bb803a0aa1b605"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-10374",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The sought-after eggs came from Blackrock Spire, where Bijou had gone weeks earlier without returning to Kibler.",["title"]="Spire Spider"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4881:description:1-82","4881:description:84-152","4881:description:154-216","4881:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4881,["sourceHash"]="4edb9001e277ebf3c8d238fec21067e9078d3ad773c0fd88aaf949ed2b9febd6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10638",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kanati Greycloud established a tauren hunting camp in Thousand Needles.",["title"]="Kanati Greycloud"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4881:description:1-82","4881:description:84-152","4881:description:154-216","4881:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4881,["sourceHash"]="4edb9001e277ebf3c8d238fec21067e9078d3ad773c0fd88aaf949ed2b9febd6"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-10638",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="An assassination plan called for attackers to converge southwest of the Great Lift and kill Kanati before more hunters followed his example.",["title"]="Kanati Greycloud"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4906:description:1-104","4906:description:106-199","4906:description:204-338","4906:description:343-401","4906:description:403-439","4906:objective:1-126","4906:objective:128-171"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4906,["sourceHash"]="d6625fe510e8424ecb95b2f6ab9deddfde36530b33cb86c171c7093e884df3ea"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10648",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Xavaric led a second satyr encampment in northern Felwood.",["title"]="Xavaric"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4906:description:1-104","4906:description:106-199","4906:description:204-338","4906:description:343-401","4906:description:403-439","4906:objective:1-126","4906:objective:128-171"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4906,["sourceHash"]="d6625fe510e8424ecb95b2f6ab9deddfde36530b33cb86c171c7093e884df3ea"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-10648",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Xavathras’s group had cultivated a corrupted moonwell and intended its spoils for Xavaric, linking the two camps’ work.",["title"]="Xavaric"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4906:description:1-104","4906:description:106-199","4906:description:204-338","4906:description:343-401","4906:description:403-439","4906:objective:1-126","4906:objective:128-171"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4906,["sourceHash"]="d6625fe510e8424ecb95b2f6ab9deddfde36530b33cb86c171c7093e884df3ea"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-10648",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Eridan described the satyrs as feeding on Felwood’s tainted creatures, making their encampments part of a wider effort to sustain corruption.",["title"]="Xavaric"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5049:description:1-155","5049:description:160-230","5049:description:232-243","5049:description:246-303","5049:description:306-354","5049:description:357-498","5049:objective:1-81","5049:objective:84-157"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5049,["sourceHash"]="e501298f0e73ea610189c723ab137a752fc2d5a701bc901609cc0adda6070326"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-8403",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jeremiah Payson sold cockroaches in the Undercity.",["title"]="Jeremiah Payson"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5049:description:1-155","5049:description:160-230","5049:description:232-243","5049:description:246-303","5049:description:306-354","5049:description:357-498","5049:objective:1-81","5049:objective:84-157"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5049,["sourceHash"]="e501298f0e73ea610189c723ab137a752fc2d5a701bc901609cc0adda6070326"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-8403",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Bauhaus directed a parcel’s bearer beneath a walkway near the bank to find him.",["title"]="Jeremiah Payson"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5127:description:1-70","5127:description:75-114","5127:description:116-171","5127:description:173-259","5127:description:261-304","5127:description:306-423","5127:objective:1-54","5127:objective:56-116","5127:objective:118-181","5127:objective:186-242","5127:objective:247-347"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5127,["sourceHash"]="ba1a1f3bcf1c41949f83ddbc346457641910ddd82a925cdea5c10fee686a8d2c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-10899",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lorax accused Goraluk of stealing a breastplate after bargaining away his soul, demanding both the armor’s return and the fulfillment of the bargain.",["title"]="Goraluk Anvilcrack"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5127:description:1-70","5127:description:75-114","5127:description:116-171","5127:description:173-259","5127:description:261-304","5127:description:306-423","5127:objective:1-54","5127:objective:56-116","5127:objective:118-181","5127:objective:186-242","5127:objective:247-347"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5127,["sourceHash"]="ba1a1f3bcf1c41949f83ddbc346457641910ddd82a925cdea5c10fee686a8d2c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-10899",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A fel-imbued pike was intended to claim Goraluk’s soul through his dying heart; in exchange, Lorax would teach the technique the smith had sought.",["title"]="Goraluk Anvilcrack"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5128:description:1-198","5128:description:203-342","5128:description:347-449","5128:description:454-474","5128:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5128,["sourceHash"]="d6d5949820c520cc9d7c1b543b1720990b30e9b985bb29a4eded2986aaaa67e8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10920",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kelek Skykeeper belonged to the Emerald Circle’s druids working to heal Felwood.",["title"]="Kelek Skykeeper"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5128:description:1-198","5128:description:203-342","5128:description:347-449","5128:description:454-474","5128:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5128,["sourceHash"]="d6d5949820c520cc9d7c1b543b1720990b30e9b985bb29a4eded2986aaaa67e8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-10920",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="His experience with furbolgs made him the recommended reader of the Winterfall high chief’s log in the search for what drove the tribe’s firewater use.",["title"]="Kelek Skykeeper"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5163:description:1-19","5163:description:24-113","5163:description:115-140","5163:description:145-302","5163:description:307-440","5163:description:445-486","5163:objective:1-57","5163:objective:62-95","5163:objective:98-128","5163:objective:131-174","5163:objective:179-235"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5163,["sourceHash"]="967fb01c825dbd9be5a64a1e362c2e62438059111c05ce9be3cad1920b29b463"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-10977",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Quixxil was Umi Rumplesnicker’s friend in Marshal’s Refuge, one of the intended recipients of her mechanical-yeti surprise.",["title"]="Quixxil"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5163:description:1-19","5163:description:24-113","5163:description:115-140","5163:description:145-302","5163:description:307-440","5163:description:445-486","5163:objective:1-57","5163:objective:62-95","5163:objective:98-128","5163:objective:131-174","5163:objective:179-235"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5163,["sourceHash"]="967fb01c825dbd9be5a64a1e362c2e62438059111c05ce9be3cad1920b29b463"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-10978",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Legacki in Everlook was among Umi’s friends marked for a visit from her mechanical yeti, after a letter promised a surprise without revealing it.",["title"]="Legacki"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5168:description:1-126","5168:description:131-237","5168:description:242-296","5168:description:299-439","5168:description:444-467","5168:description:470-505","5168:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5168,["sourceHash"]="6cf2974cc56892edc355b6180a5f9ca2cd5dde67f5278365bdd62be1d9e94ec8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-10937",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Captain Redpath’s betrayal was remembered in the Annals of Darrowshire alongside the deeds of the town’s defenders.",["title"]="Captain Redpath"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5168:description:1-126","5168:description:131-237","5168:description:242-296","5168:description:299-439","5168:description:444-467","5168:description:470-505","5168:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5168,["sourceHash"]="6cf2974cc56892edc355b6180a5f9ca2cd5dde67f5278365bdd62be1d9e94ec8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-10937",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Carlin Redpath was his brother and sought the captain’s broken shield, discarded near the barn at Gahrron’s Withering.",["title"]="Captain Redpath"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5204:description:1-42","5204:description:44-160","5204:description:162-299","5204:description:301-331","5204:description:336-404","5204:description:406-509","5204:objective:1-95"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5204,["sourceHash"]="079e1bf1023a3e88a473f6487abc45c60b2942fce7e581c361802c0b33f97550"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11018",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jessir Moonbow believed Arko’narin concealed how deeply Trey’s death and torture had hurt her, despite her attempts to seem strong.",["title"]="Arko'narin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5204:description:1-42","5204:description:44-160","5204:description:162-299","5204:description:301-331","5204:description:336-404","5204:description:406-509","5204:objective:1-95"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5204,["sourceHash"]="079e1bf1023a3e88a473f6487abc45c60b2942fce7e581c361802c0b33f97550"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11018",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jessir hoped recovering Trey’s remains and confronting his torturer in Shadow Hold could give Arko’narin a measure of peace while she mourned.",["title"]="Arko'narin"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5242:description:1-85","5242:description:87-171","5242:description:173-227","5242:description:229-268","5242:description:270-291","5242:description:293-312","5242:description:314-352","5242:description:354-383","5242:description:385-440","5242:description:442-489","5242:description:491-509","5242:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5242,["sourceHash"]="8440db7c1ff665709e1057502784f77809bf24a12660fe09b0c3066034a7f777"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-9517",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Shadow Lord Fel’dan was the mortal commanding the depths of Shadow Hold and arranging pacts with the Burning Legion.",["title"]="Shadow Lord Fel'dan"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5242:description:1-85","5242:description:87-171","5242:description:173-227","5242:description:229-268","5242:description:270-291","5242:description:293-312","5242:description:314-352","5242:description:354-383","5242:description:385-440","5242:description:442-489","5242:description:491-509","5242:objective:1-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5242,["sourceHash"]="8440db7c1ff665709e1057502784f77809bf24a12660fe09b0c3066034a7f777"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-9517",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Two succubus servants attended him at the bottom of the hold.",["title"]="Shadow Lord Fel'dan"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5251:description:1-59","5251:description:61-98","5251:description:100-162","5251:description:164-227","5251:description:232-256","5251:description:261-397","5251:description:399-437","5251:description:439-487","5251:objective:1-71","5251:objective:73-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5251,["sourceHash"]="38924bf7a10d176e0059c8dc8893b2c168d557bb00dea788babfe9a68ffa492c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10811",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Archivist Galford watched over the Scarlet Crusade’s most valued documents in Stratholme.",["title"]="Archivist Galford"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5251:description:1-59","5251:description:61-98","5251:description:100-162","5251:description:164-227","5251:description:232-256","5251:description:261-397","5251:description:399-437","5251:description:439-487","5251:objective:1-71","5251:objective:73-118"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5251,["sourceHash"]="38924bf7a10d176e0059c8dc8893b2c168d557bb00dea788babfe9a68ffa492c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-10811",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff’s order to destroy Galford and burn his archives was directed against the Crusade’s violent fanaticism as well as its store of intelligence.",["title"]="Archivist Galford"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5321:description:1-110","5321:description:112-178","5321:description:183-188","5321:description:193-226","5321:description:228-306","5321:description:308-378","5321:description:383-459","5321:description:461-493","5321:objective:1-80"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5321,["sourceHash"]="b8e6baee3c232cdd6589d86f87a960d7171b5c044eae19f0427045e6c3951bfc"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11218",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kerlonian Evershade struggled to stay awake after returning from the Emerald Dream. Even the road to meet Liladris at Maestra’s Post became difficult because he might fall asleep along the way.",["title"]="Kerlonian Evershade"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5321:description:1-110","5321:description:112-178","5321:description:183-188","5321:description:193-226","5321:description:228-306","5321:description:308-378","5321:description:383-459","5321:description:461-493","5321:objective:1-80"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5321,["sourceHash"]="b8e6baee3c232cdd6589d86f87a960d7171b5c044eae19f0427045e6c3951bfc"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11218",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kerlonian was traveling to meet Liladris Moonriver, and offered his horn as a way for an escort to wake him if he dozed off.",["title"]="Kerlonian Evershade"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5321:description:1-110","5321:description:112-178","5321:description:183-188","5321:description:193-226","5321:description:228-306","5321:description:308-378","5321:description:383-459","5321:description:461-493","5321:objective:1-80"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5321,["sourceHash"]="b8e6baee3c232cdd6589d86f87a960d7171b5c044eae19f0427045e6c3951bfc"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-11219",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Liladris Moonriver awaited Kerlonian Evershade at Maestra’s Post in Ashenvale.",["title"]="Liladris Moonriver"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5321:description:1-110","5321:description:112-178","5321:description:183-188","5321:description:193-226","5321:description:228-306","5321:description:308-378","5321:description:383-459","5321:description:461-493","5321:objective:1-80","5321:completion:1-36","5321:completion:38-104","5321:completion:109-146"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5321,["sourceHash"]="b8e6baee3c232cdd6589d86f87a960d7171b5c044eae19f0427045e6c3951bfc"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11219",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Liladris was relieved to hear Kerlonian had arrived, and already expected to find him asleep somewhere nearby.",["title"]="Liladris Moonriver"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5386:description:1-73","5386:description:75-139","5386:description:141-233","5386:description:235-240","5386:description:245-292","5386:description:294-381","5386:description:383-445","5386:objective:1-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5386,["sourceHash"]="c1ad6818c17f0536ea3825224cb38dc0f291776a5967d0c23b28dfa549b6e238"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-11317",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Jinar’Zillen was a fisherman at Shadowprey Village, where Nataka Longhorn sent a traveler to obtain Bloodbelly fish.",["title"]="Jinar'Zillen"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5386:description:1-73","5386:description:75-139","5386:description:141-233","5386:description:235-240","5386:description:245-292","5386:description:294-381","5386:description:383-445","5386:objective:1-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5386,["sourceHash"]="c1ad6818c17f0536ea3825224cb38dc0f291776a5967d0c23b28dfa549b6e238"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11317",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nataka praised Shadowprey’s troll fishers but could not spare time to visit while centaur troubles kept her at Ghost Walker Post.",["title"]="Jinar'Zillen"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5541:description:1-54","5541:description:57-173","5541:description:178-183","5541:description:185-241","5541:description:244-326","5541:description:328-370","5541:description:375-426","5541:description:429-482","5541:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5541,["sourceHash"]="238360dbddbda193eac40ad5db0635589c747167416f9633b8435c5a0253f196"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-1243",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hegnar Rumbleshot sold guns beside the road to Anvilmar and supplied riflemen and mortar teams practicing near his shop.",["title"]="Hegnar Rumbleshot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5541:description:1-54","5541:description:57-173","5541:description:178-183","5541:description:185-241","5541:description:244-326","5541:description:328-370","5541:description:375-426","5541:description:429-482","5541:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5541,["sourceHash"]="238360dbddbda193eac40ad5db0635589c747167416f9633b8435c5a0253f196"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-1243",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="His ammunition shipment went missing after wendigo drove Loslor Rudge’s courier from a camp near the Grizzled Den.",["title"]="Hegnar Rumbleshot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5541:description:1-54","5541:description:57-173","5541:description:178-183","5541:description:185-241","5541:description:244-326","5541:description:328-370","5541:description:375-426","5541:description:429-482","5541:objective:1-59","5541:completion:1-17","5541:completion:19-61","5541:completion:63-157","5541:completion:162-180","5541:completion:182-224"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5541,["sourceHash"]="238360dbddbda193eac40ad5db0635589c747167416f9633b8435c5a0253f196"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1243",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Rumbleshot already had eager buyers waiting when Loslor’s delayed ammunition finally reached him.",["title"]="Hegnar Rumbleshot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5561:description:1-76","5561:description:79-149","5561:description:152-310","5561:description:315-453","5561:description:456-503","5561:objective:1-101"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5561,["sourceHash"]="fd0ffb26e35564d8eb02e749a49fa71dacdda957ca89f86c57b9c777286abd32"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-11596",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Smeed Scrabblescrew supplied tamed kodos to the caravan that traveled through Desolace, in partnership with Cork and Rigger.",["title"]="Smeed Scrabblescrew"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5561:description:1-76","5561:description:79-149","5561:description:152-310","5561:description:315-453","5561:description:456-503","5561:objective:1-101"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5561,["sourceHash"]="fd0ffb26e35564d8eb02e749a49fa71dacdda957ca89f86c57b9c777286abd32"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11596",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="His kodo kombobulator could rejuvenate and control aged or dying kodos, compelling a treated beast to follow its handler back to camp.",["title"]="Smeed Scrabblescrew"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5561:description:1-76","5561:description:79-149","5561:description:152-310","5561:description:315-453","5561:description:456-503","5561:objective:1-101","5561:completion:1-38","5561:completion:43-66","5561:completion:68-134","5561:completion:136-159","5561:completion:161-175","5561:completion:177-253"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5561,["sourceHash"]="fd0ffb26e35564d8eb02e749a49fa71dacdda957ca89f86c57b9c777286abd32"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-11596",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Smeed counted the delivered kodos with thoughts of growing rich and showing Bibbly that he was not Desolace’s only enterprising goblin.",["title"]="Smeed Scrabblescrew"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5629:description:1-16","5629:description:18-106","5629:description:108-159","5629:description:161-266","5629:description:268-338","5629:description:340-359","5629:description:361-397","5629:objective:1-40"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5629,["sourceHash"]="34668c1b2b1e47f26bb349bf2b94cab510b1e57db89bbd14501573c43b079a44"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-11401",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Priestess Alathea called promising priests back to the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus when the elders judged them ready for further training.",["title"]="Priestess Alathea"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5629:description:1-16","5629:description:18-106","5629:description:108-159","5629:description:161-266","5629:description:268-338","5629:description:340-359","5629:description:361-397","5629:objective:1-40","5629:completion:1-36","5629:completion:38-145","5629:completion:147-176","5629:completion:178-213","5629:completion:215-309"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5629,["sourceHash"]="34668c1b2b1e47f26bb349bf2b94cab510b1e57db89bbd14501573c43b079a44"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11401",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Alathea spoke of the pleasure she and Tyrande took in seeing their pupils return safely, and wanted to hear about the traveler’s experiences after their immediate business.",["title"]="Priestess Alathea"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5644:description:1-32","5644:description:34-128","5644:description:130-210","5644:description:215-322","5644:description:324-336","5644:description:338-362","5644:description:367-410","5644:description:412-455","5644:objective:1-38"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5644,["sourceHash"]="8fd5ad476f4ae641c57e4ec4673ad19e7b992a25f93c3692bc9ae3f3a5f027e2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-4606",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Aelthalyste received returning pupils in the Undercity’s War Quarter.",["title"]="Aelthalyste"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5644:description:1-32","5644:description:34-128","5644:description:130-210","5644:description:215-322","5644:description:324-336","5644:description:338-362","5644:description:367-410","5644:description:412-455","5644:objective:1-38","5644:completion:1-68","5644:completion:70-135","5644:completion:137-180"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5644,["sourceHash"]="8fd5ad476f4ae641c57e4ec4673ad19e7b992a25f93c3692bc9ae3f3a5f027e2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-4606",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Aelthalyste offered instruction in Devouring Plague to those she considered prepared, warning that practice would precede later tests.",["title"]="Aelthalyste"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5522:description:1-44","5522:description:47-137","5522:description:140-230","5522:description:235-275","5522:description:278-367","5522:description:372-382","5522:description:385-392","5522:description:395-418","5522:description:421-437","5522:description:439-510","5522:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5522,["sourceHash"]="a36dac7838191ec751ba0e3fec1307791f3332c7dac23e4a3fb4d334d70a697a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-10432",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Tinkee Steamboil called Vectus her master and believed a message bearing Leonid Barthalomew’s name conveyed his instructions about the dragon eggs.",["title"]="Vectus"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5522:description:1-44","5522:description:47-137","5522:description:140-230","5522:description:235-275","5522:description:278-367","5522:description:372-382","5522:description:385-392","5522:description:395-418","5522:description:421-437","5522:description:439-510","5522:objective:1-71","5522:completion:1-14","5522:completion:16-105","5522:completion:107-151","5522:completion:153-234","5522:completion:239-298","5522:completion:300-459"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=5522,["sourceHash"]="a36dac7838191ec751ba0e3fec1307791f3332c7dac23e4a3fb4d334d70a697a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-11036",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Leonid admitted deceiving Tinkee to divert the dragon eggs from their intended destination. He denied serving her master and feared the power the eggs would put in enemy hands.",["title"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5306:description:1-34","5306:description:36-90","5306:description:95-134","5306:description:139-188","5306:description:193-232","5306:description:237-279","5306:description:281-326","5306:description:328-391","5306:objective:1-60","5306:objective:62-114"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5306,["sourceHash"]="ddf54be104ce6a1e0c74b2a10a852803f2645426594cea853c758107ee0999e8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-unit-11192",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kilram attributed the scar on his face to Shadow Hunter Vosh’gajin, remembering that she had called the wound a love tap.",["title"]="Kilram"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5306:description:1-34","5306:description:36-90","5306:description:95-134","5306:description:139-188","5306:description:193-232","5306:description:237-279","5306:description:281-326","5306:description:328-391","5306:objective:1-60","5306:objective:62-114"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5306,["sourceHash"]="ddf54be104ce6a1e0c74b2a10a852803f2645426594cea853c758107ee0999e8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-11192",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Kilram sought revenge on Vosh’gajin and offered to teach the forging of Dawn’s Edge in exchange for her snakestone.",["title"]="Kilram"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5307:description:1-43","5307:description:45-180","5307:description:185-219","5307:description:224-284","5307:description:286-293","5307:description:298-408","5307:objective:1-62","5307:objective:64-135"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5307,["sourceHash"]="b12dd53c1cf74efea3ab5aa31c01e591a9af3e0143fafb52e394b02fe87c5ee2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-11193",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Seril Scourgebane blamed Rivendare’s Black Guard for stealing the plans of the blade Corruption; their undead swordsmith guarded the stolen knowledge.",["title"]="Seril Scourgebane"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5881:description:1-47","5881:description:49-109","5881:description:114-237","5881:description:239-381","5881:description:383-452","5881:objective:1-92"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5881,["sourceHash"]="2029a965f0a15df78d07d23b7185f74a5621b7b5ea7a25496cf12a8ae4531924"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-12576",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Grish Longrunner guarded the Great Lift in the southern Barrens.",["title"]="Grish Longrunner"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5881:description:1-47","5881:description:49-109","5881:description:114-237","5881:description:239-381","5881:description:383-452","5881:objective:1-92"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5881,["sourceHash"]="2029a965f0a15df78d07d23b7185f74a5621b7b5ea7a25496cf12a8ae4531924"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="motivation",["id"]="catalog-unit-12576",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Grish had asked for leave to visit his family. A letter announced that a reserve warrior would relieve him of duty.",["title"]="Grish Longrunner"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5929:description:1-108","5929:description:111-216","5929:description:219-298","5929:description:303-363","5929:description:366-428","5929:description:431-505","5929:objective:1-126","5929:objective:129-197"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5929,["sourceHash"]="43206825540b8d912890df7d158d2fc53d12605f2fc0b7e1234dcdf4b6566ae2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-11956",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Great Bear Spirit served druids as a tutor in understanding the bear, a mentor whose wisdom they sought during their early training.",["title"]="Great Bear Spirit"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5929:description:1-108","5929:description:111-216","5929:description:219-298","5929:description:303-363","5929:description:366-428","5929:description:431-505","5929:objective:1-126","5929:objective:129-197"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5929,["sourceHash"]="43206825540b8d912890df7d158d2fc53d12605f2fc0b7e1234dcdf4b6566ae2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-11956",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The spirit’s home lay in the northwestern part of Moonglade, away from the instructor waiting in Nighthaven.",["title"]="Great Bear Spirit"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2869:description:1-159","2869:description:162-239","2869:description:244-349","2869:description:352-508","2869:objective:1-81"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2869,["sourceHash"]="29eb2094d899e14c3efbad4ca19136e99439f2dfa11344a47ec52475153f0819"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1120",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The growing Hatecrest presence prompted a preemptive campaign on Sardor Isle. Their opponents feared the naga would try to secure the island, while admitting their actual plans remained unknown.",["title"]="Sardor Isle"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2879:description:1-41","2879:description:43-185","2879:description:190-276","2879:description:278-388","2879:description:390-508","2879:objective:1-53"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2879,["sourceHash"]="b4475e5fbbb1c9a4f6bf2acb293c64c1ea078b367ff7fc7f53f946fa7aa0e530"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1111",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Dream Bough stood east of the Ruins of Ravenwind on the Feralas mainland, a landmark in directions to the Equinex Monolith.",["title"]="Dream Bough"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2963:description:1-25","2963:description:28-109","2963:description:112-203","2963:description:206-317","2963:description:322-448","2963:description:451-502","2963:objective:1-70"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2963,["sourceHash"]="3539470caf06471dd7c553b193c9ec0e6ba9e113a4cabd72629429d873ed3670"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-990",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Clues uncovered by Historian Karnik drew the Explorers’ League’s attention to this valley in the Tanaris desert during its study of the miniature platinum discs from Uldaman.",["title"]="Valley of the Watchers"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"2965:description:1-56","2965:description:59-142","2965:description:145-331","2965:description:336-449","2965:description:452-487","2965:objective:1-60"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=2965,["sourceHash"]="d9aee4d2a2fd35abd40615d5f02396a7344a7a590af1f47c3d4f67c91010f7bd"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-location-area-990",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Nara Wildmane had traveled to the valley. Her experiences offered another lead for the sages investigating the revelations from Uldaman.",["title"]="Valley of the Watchers"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3281:description:1-77","3281:description:80-188","3281:description:191-245","3281:description:250-306","3281:description:309-342","3281:objective:1-52"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3281,["sourceHash"]="3c67ac6a275863712273a547b34ba886bf0bef3304cfa6c2da6c731d44570288"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1697",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Raptor Grounds were a large concentration of raptor nests south of Ratchet.",["title"]="Raptor Grounds"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3281:description:1-77","3281:description:80-188","3281:description:191-245","3281:description:250-306","3281:description:309-342","3281:objective:1-52"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3281,["sourceHash"]="3c67ac6a275863712273a547b34ba886bf0bef3304cfa6c2da6c731d44570288"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-location-area-1697",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Reports of the nesting grounds made them the suspected hiding place of silver stolen by raptors, prompting a search among the nests.",["title"]="Raptor Grounds"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3368:description:1-8","3368:description:13-57","3368:description:59-134","3368:description:139-216","3368:description:218-314","3368:description:316-347","3368:description:349-433","3368:description:438-456","3368:description:458-492","3368:description:497-503","3368:objective:1-47","3368:objective:49-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3368,["sourceHash"]="e524cbd4fa77b760dc4d712291ea93d13aed73ea62047b788664ece73881988a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="catalog-location-area-246",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dorius’s final letter reported that Lathoric the Black held the Suntara stones and used their power to enslave his excavation team in the Cauldron.",["title"]="The Cauldron"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3368:description:1-8","3368:description:13-57","3368:description:59-134","3368:description:139-216","3368:description:218-314","3368:description:316-347","3368:description:349-433","3368:description:438-456","3368:description:458-492","3368:description:497-503","3368:objective:1-47","3368:objective:49-79"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3368,["sourceHash"]="e524cbd4fa77b760dc4d712291ea93d13aed73ea62047b788664ece73881988a"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-location-area-246",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="According to Dorius, the enthralled excavators labored day and night on something called Obsidion. His final request was for his brother to help them.",["title"]="The Cauldron"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"3385:description:1-131","3385:description:136-153","3385:description:155-218","3385:description:220-326","3385:description:331-389","3385:description:391-435","3385:description:437-489","3385:description:494-509","3385:objective:1-45","3385:objective:47-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=3385,["sourceHash"]="06de3c71d67392e59b5d6590d9ff204a0209eafa16ba6ca87952ba5f66709a25"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-location-area-246",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Trade Master Kovic and Clunk operated from the Cauldron as the Undermarket established itself in the Searing Gorge; Kovic’s dealings linked the traders to local Dark Irons.",["title"]="The Cauldron"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6001:description:1-50","6001:description:53-111","6001:description:114-209","6001:description:212-288","6001:description:293-352","6001:description:354-470","6001:objective:1-84","6001:objective:87-174","6001:objective:179-242"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6001,["sourceHash"]="c14c0df84b0072e73895d4f75a2d25049890bffc830152259cc986d5fefebc9f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-12138",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Lunaclaw defended a Moonkin Stone and embodied the strength of body and heart sought by druids learning the way of the Claw.",["title"]="Lunaclaw"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6001:description:1-50","6001:description:53-111","6001:description:114-209","6001:description:212-288","6001:description:293-352","6001:description:354-470","6001:objective:1-84","6001:objective:87-174","6001:objective:179-242"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6001,["sourceHash"]="c14c0df84b0072e73895d4f75a2d25049890bffc830152259cc986d5fefebc9f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-12138",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="One Moonkin Stone associated with Lunaclaw lay in the moonkin cave closest to Auberdine, east of the settlement.",["title"]="Lunaclaw"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6002:description:1-98","6002:description:101-158","6002:description:161-247","6002:description:250-326","6002:description:331-391","6002:description:393-509","6002:objective:1-104","6002:objective:107-194","6002:objective:199-260"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6002,["sourceHash"]="aa01eecbfacc81031dd536e6a793f6dbf26763f5f52abe98a46833792ed6083c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-12138",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The Barrens rite directed a druid to a Moonkin Stone west of Taurajo, near the land’s transition into Mulgore. Applying Cenarion Lunardust would call forth its defender.",["title"]="Lunaclaw"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6021:description:1-73","6021:description:75-109","6021:description:112-154","6021:description:159-192","6021:description:195-213","6021:description:218-428","6021:description:433-467","6021:description:470-503","6021:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6021,["sourceHash"]="b68ae7efcb035e8aa660c6616c3bfcafd1a9512332d4fb25f3254c01d1a723c7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-12250",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Caretaker Alen described Zaeldarr as a large undead troll leading other dead trolls.",["title"]="Zaeldarr the Outcast"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6021:description:1-73","6021:description:75-109","6021:description:112-154","6021:description:159-192","6021:description:195-213","6021:description:218-428","6021:description:433-467","6021:description:470-503","6021:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6021,["sourceHash"]="b68ae7efcb035e8aa660c6616c3bfcafd1a9512332d4fb25f3254c01d1a723c7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-12250",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Alen accused Zaeldarr’s followers of stealing bodies from his pit at night and carrying them back to the Undercroft.",["title"]="Zaeldarr the Outcast"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6021:description:1-73","6021:description:75-109","6021:description:112-154","6021:description:159-192","6021:description:195-213","6021:description:218-428","6021:description:433-467","6021:description:470-503","6021:objective:1-63"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6021,["sourceHash"]="b68ae7efcb035e8aa660c6616c3bfcafd1a9512332d4fb25f3254c01d1a723c7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-12250",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Zaeldarr’s band used the Undercroft, west of Alen’s burial pit, as its hideout.",["title"]="Zaeldarr the Outcast"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6023:description:1-122","6023:description:124-212","6023:description:214-401","6023:description:403-439","6023:description:441-501","6023:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6023,["sourceHash"]="866a446f1c66d84a144768c98c9f54dcfdfa49ece3d84549c6a7104f07a3743f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-11611",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Cavalier Durgen was one of two Scarlet officers identified as the backbone of the Crusade’s outlying forces around Hearthglen.",["title"]="Cavalier Durgen"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6023:description:1-122","6023:description:124-212","6023:description:214-401","6023:description:403-439","6023:description:441-501","6023:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6023,["sourceHash"]="866a446f1c66d84a144768c98c9f54dcfdfa49ece3d84549c6a7104f07a3743f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="relationships",["id"]="catalog-unit-11611",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Durgen and Huntsman Radley became targets of a wounded scout’s effort to weaken the Crusade before investigating Hearthglen itself.",["title"]="Cavalier Durgen"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6023:description:1-122","6023:description:124-212","6023:description:214-401","6023:description:403-439","6023:description:441-501","6023:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6023,["sourceHash"]="866a446f1c66d84a144768c98c9f54dcfdfa49ece3d84549c6a7104f07a3743f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-11613",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Huntsman Radley was reported along Hearthglen Pass outside the town proper.",["title"]="Huntsman Radley"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6023:description:1-122","6023:description:124-212","6023:description:214-401","6023:description:403-439","6023:description:441-501","6023:objective:1-102"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6023,["sourceHash"]="866a446f1c66d84a144768c98c9f54dcfdfa49ece3d84549c6a7104f07a3743f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="conflict",["id"]="catalog-unit-11613",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="A scout discovered while gathering intelligence on Hearthglen sought help striking Radley and Cavalier Durgen, important members of the Crusade’s surrounding forces.",["title"]="Huntsman Radley"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6028:description:1-96","6028:description:99-194","6028:description:197-359","6028:description:364-488","6028:objective:1-95"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6028,["sourceHash"]="7de5a8cb3f80f5bb3a807b2f19891f5a8f5d799dd2b0b6cbf4f9cfa56e64abb7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10840",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Argent Officer Pureheart supervised the Dawn representative reporting on Everlook’s local governance.",["title"]="Argent Officer Pureheart"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6028:description:1-96","6028:description:99-194","6028:description:197-359","6028:description:364-488","6028:objective:1-95"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6028,["sourceHash"]="7de5a8cb3f80f5bb3a807b2f19891f5a8f5d799dd2b0b6cbf4f9cfa56e64abb7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-10840",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Pureheart received the Everlook progress report at Chillwind Camp on the southern fringe of the Western Plaguelands.",["title"]="Argent Officer Pureheart"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6029:description:1-95","6029:description:98-193","6029:description:196-376","6029:description:381-505","6029:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6029,["sourceHash"]="16f9f4c86275e325e2233986ad78592bda8471e25f313b3609a9d31064204e33"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10839",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Argent Officer Garush was the superior to whom the Dawn’s representative at Everlook sent a progress report.",["title"]="Argent Officer Garush"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6029:description:1-95","6029:description:98-193","6029:description:196-376","6029:description:381-505","6029:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6029,["sourceHash"]="16f9f4c86275e325e2233986ad78592bda8471e25f313b3609a9d31064204e33"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-10839",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Garush was stationed at the Bulwark on the western edge of the Western Plaguelands, east of Tirisfal Glades.",["title"]="Argent Officer Garush"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6061:description:1-100","6061:description:102-214","6061:description:219-314","6061:description:316-375","6061:description:377-433","6061:description:435-503","6061:objective:1-49","6061:objective:51-137"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6061,["sourceHash"]="55dab6d51df7c5d8dd5384a684273f2241df38f89fed3ea596eba32fbb06f404"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-2956",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Adult plainstriders were the first companions used in a tauren hunter’s taming practice, part of instruction connecting respect for beasts with closeness to the Earthmother.",["title"]="Adult Plainstrider"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6062:description:1-64","6062:description:66-172","6062:description:177-287","6062:description:292-378","6062:description:380-423","6062:description:425-501","6062:objective:1-47","6062:objective:49-121"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6062,["sourceHash"]="5370725553887c15ec3cb6dd9bd2f319593261c448236e99a92ba489df82cb8f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3099",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Dire mottled boars could be found near Razor Hill, where fledgling hunters practiced taming and fighting beside a companion.",["title"]="Dire Mottled Boar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6063:description:1-83","6063:description:85-242","6063:description:247-364","6063:description:369-411","6063:description:413-463","6063:description:465-510","6063:objective:1-44","6063:objective:46-117"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6063,["sourceHash"]="709ee7b1ecb2b197ee5356b5d657855d5f106a7d9eb300f33e2a09b4c539b45d"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1998",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Webwood lurkers served as early companions in hunter instruction that emphasized respecting nature rather than treating it as a power made merely to obey.",["title"]="Webwood Lurker"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6064:description:1-22","6064:description:24-87","6064:description:92-115","6064:description:117-254","6064:description:256-332","6064:description:337-433","6064:description:435-497","6064:objective:1-45","6064:objective:47-125"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6064,["sourceHash"]="f6a6cf16526f95fdf0aa7515d7ef36070484d83c0f674f3acc2f69d6c1cad7d1"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1126",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Large crag boars were among the first beasts offered to a Dun Morogh hunter learning through practical experience with different companions.",["title"]="Large Crag Boar"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6081:description:1-84","6081:description:89-108","6081:description:110-181","6081:description:183-233","6081:description:235-275","6081:description:280-293","6081:objective:1-39"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6081,["sourceHash"]="ea12c3d014885903a35e2ebc4051b6b3db6af4bb6aa5b88bce94926f75a05006"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="npc-3352",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ormak Grimshot was a revered Orgrimmar hunter who instructed those ready to train their newly tamed pets.",["title"]="Ormak Grimshot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6081:description:1-84","6081:description:89-108","6081:description:110-181","6081:description:183-233","6081:description:235-275","6081:description:280-293","6081:objective:1-39"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6081,["sourceHash"]="ea12c3d014885903a35e2ebc4051b6b3db6af4bb6aa5b88bce94926f75a05006"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="npc-3352",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ormak taught in Orgrimmar’s Valley of Honor.",["title"]="Ormak Grimshot"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6082:description:1-93","6082:description:95-187","6082:description:192-331","6082:description:333-396","6082:description:398-460","6082:objective:1-46","6082:objective:48-105"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6082,["sourceHash"]="7eb8252bdd0dacba0b0758a04847c35f7627a08f4e164f75e6866278a638a06f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3126",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="The armored scorpid’s quick, confident strikes made it an example held up to a hunter approaching the end of the taming trials.",["title"]="Armored Scorpid"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6083:description:1-70","6083:description:72-152","6083:description:154-199","6083:description:204-313","6083:description:315-363","6083:description:365-413","6083:description:415-471","6083:objective:1-42","6083:objective:44-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6083,["sourceHash"]="febfdafa9735039800147f3ac4455cc6db7581078695512ee7e49564ed1525ad"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-3107",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Surf crawlers inhabited the coastal waters across from Sen’jin Village, near the Echo Isles.",["title"]="Surf Crawler"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6083:description:1-70","6083:description:72-152","6083:description:154-199","6083:description:204-313","6083:description:315-363","6083:description:365-413","6083:description:415-471","6083:objective:1-42","6083:objective:44-116"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6083,["sourceHash"]="febfdafa9735039800147f3ac4455cc6db7581078695512ee7e49564ed1525ad"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-3107",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Described as spirited crabs, surf crawlers offered hunters a waterside companion after their first lessons with land beasts.",["title"]="Surf Crawler"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6084:description:1-88","6084:description:90-127","6084:description:129-202","6084:description:204-329","6084:description:331-403","6084:description:408-466","6084:objective:1-42","6084:objective:44-107"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6084,["sourceHash"]="03d632b4c4d46a76a42a32af261bcb8c949a9c96b2e84ee7fcc845a5655d06b5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="appearance",["id"]="catalog-unit-1201",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Snow leopards were large white cats whose attractive appearance concealed powerful fighters.",["title"]="Snow Leopard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6084:description:1-88","6084:description:90-127","6084:description:129-202","6084:description:204-329","6084:description:331-403","6084:description:408-466","6084:objective:1-42","6084:objective:44-107"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6084,["sourceHash"]="03d632b4c4d46a76a42a32af261bcb8c949a9c96b2e84ee7fcc845a5655d06b5"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1201",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Hunter instruction contrasted the snow leopard’s agility and speed with the burlier crag boar.",["title"]="Snow Leopard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6085:description:1-77","6085:description:79-194","6085:description:196-266","6085:description:271-444","6085:description:446-507","6085:objective:1-44","6085:objective:46-124"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6085,["sourceHash"]="7504193e9cc881b8bb2d583cb9fba22b120f577fcb5ea1019b4d70047acc33b7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalog-unit-1196",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Ice claw bears could be found east of Kharanos.",["title"]="Ice Claw Bear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6085:description:1-77","6085:description:79-194","6085:description:196-266","6085:description:271-444","6085:description:446-507","6085:objective:1-44","6085:objective:46-124"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6085,["sourceHash"]="7504193e9cc881b8bb2d583cb9fba22b120f577fcb5ea1019b4d70047acc33b7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="catalog-unit-1196",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="An ice claw bear was offered as a companion to hunters interested in brute strength during their final taming practice.",["title"]="Ice Claw Bear"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6086:description:1-87","6086:description:92-137","6086:description:139-224","6086:description:226-299","6086:description:304-378","6086:description:380-393","6086:objective:1-45"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6086,["sourceHash"]="89ee60564d087f60f079b27e5d38f26dd053a45a9d522eb40979a847159a1c92"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="catalog-unit-10090",["qualification"]="Source-attributed description; not native appearance capture, current spawn verification or a personal encounter.",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="retained-quest-biography-2026-10-26-r3",["text"]="Belia Thundergranite was a respected animal trainer who taught hunters how to train their new companions.",["title"]="Belia Thundergranite"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="CONTEXTUAL_RECALL",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"6086:description:1-87","6086:description:92-137","6086:description:139-224","6086:description:226-299","6086:description:304-378","6086:description:380-393","6086:objective:1-45"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=6086,["sourceHash"]="89ee60564d087f60f079b27e5d38f26dd053a45a9d522eb40979a847159a1c92"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="catalo